msgid "\"Don't even think about it.\""
msgstr "\"Jangan coba-coba.\""

msgid "\"I was fine. It was quiet in there.\""
msgstr "\"Aku baik-baik saja. Di dalam sana tenang.\""

msgid "\"I was floating. On my back.\""
msgstr "\"Aku sedang mengapung. Telentang.\""

msgid "\"You summoned me with that pathetic chalk circle?\""
msgstr "\"Kamu memanggilku dengan lingkaran kapur menyedihkan itu?\""

