msgstr "+%d ⭐ untuk membantumu"

msgid "+1 heart"
msgstr "+1 hati"

msgid "+2 moves — great answer!"
msgstr "+2 langkah — jawaban bagus!"

msgid "+5 hearts · %s"
msgstr "+5 hati · %s"

msgid "-1 move"
msgstr "-1 langkah"

msgid "...Two hundred springs."
msgstr "...Dua ratus musim semi."

msgid "1 star for every 200 points. Save up for power-ups in the Item Shop, then try again!"
msgstr "1 bintang untuk setiap 200 poin. Kumpulkan untuk membeli bantuan di Toko Item, lalu coba lagi!"

msgid "1,800 stars."
msgstr "1.800 bintang."

msgid "150 stars."
msgstr "150 bintang."

msgid "18+ · original characters · all characters are adults."
msgstr "18+ · karakter orisinal · semua karakter sudah dewasa."

msgid "200 stars, 2 of every item and 1 hour of unlimited hearts. Once per player."
msgstr "200 bintang, 2 dari setiap item, dan 1 jam hati tanpa batas. Sekali per pemain."

msgid "5 Extra Hearts"
msgstr "5 Hati Tambahan"

msgid "5 hearts right now, on top of the ones you have."
msgstr "5 hati sekarang juga, di atas yang sudah kamu punya."

msgid "5 of every item in the Item Shop."
msgstr "5 dari setiap item di Toko Item."

msgid "5,000 stars."
msgstr "5.000 bintang."

msgid "800 stars."
msgstr "800 bintang."

msgid "A Lovely Trench"
msgstr "Parit yang Indah"

msgid "A Quiet Place"
msgstr "Tempat yang Tenang"

msgid "A Thousand Sparkles"
msgstr "Seribu Kilauan"

msgid "A clock that only works when the sun's out."
msgstr "Jam yang hanya bekerja kalau matahari bersinar."

msgid "A cold breeze"
msgstr "Angin dingin"

msgid "A comb piece!"
msgstr "Kepingan sisir!"

msgid "A comb piece! %d / %d"
msgstr "Kepingan sisir! %d / %d"

msgid "A folding brass sundial small enough for a pocket. It only tells the time on sunny days, which as far as she's concerned are the only days that need it."
msgstr "Jam matahari lipat dari kuningan, cukup kecil untuk saku. Hanya menunjukkan waktu saat cerah, dan menurutnya hanya hari cerah yang memang butuh jam."

msgid "A free date"
msgstr "Kencan bebas"

msgid "A glass marble with a ribbon of gold twisted through it, the kind nobody's made for decades."
msgstr "Kelereng kaca dengan pita emas terpilin di dalamnya, jenis yang sudah puluhan tahun tidak dibuat lagi."

msgid "A leaf drops into your hair. There's no wind."
msgstr "Sehelai daun jatuh di rambutmu. Tidak ada angin."

msgid "A little buzz when gems match."
msgstr "Getaran kecil saat permata cocok."

msgid "A match-3 romance for adults, set in Millbrook, a twilight town where fantastical folk make their home. Meet four women in the worst way possible, help them with what they need, and see where the night goes."
msgstr "Romansa match-3 untuk orang dewasa, berlatar di Millbrook, kota senja tempat makhluk-makhluk fantastis tinggal. Temui empat wanita dengan cara terburuk, bantu mereka dengan apa yang mereka butuhkan, dan lihat ke mana malam membawa kalian."

msgid "A match-3 romance in Millbrook. Meet four women in the worst way possible, help them with what they need, and see where it goes."
msgstr "Romansa match-3 di Millbrook. Temui empat wanita dengan cara terburuk, bantu mereka dengan apa yang mereka butuhkan, dan lihat ke mana arahnya."

msgid "A new best!"
msgstr "Rekor baru!"

msgid "A new board every day, the same for everyone: %d moves, one try. Come back tomorrow for the next."
msgstr "Papan baru setiap hari, sama untuk semua orang: %d langkah, satu kali coba. Kembali besok untuk yang berikutnya."

msgid "A new seed drops in."
msgstr "Benih baru jatuh."

msgid "A reader shushes you"
msgstr "Seorang pembaca menyuruhmu diam"

msgid "A sapling beside the new millrace, a ribbon tied round it."
msgstr "Sebatang pohon muda di samping saluran kincir baru, seutas pita terikat di sekelilingnya."

msgid "A smooth chip of sea glass, worn soft by years of tide, on a plain cord."
msgstr "Sepotong kaca laut yang licin, dihaluskan bertahun-tahun oleh pasang surut, pada seutas tali sederhana."

msgid "A squall comes in over the cove. She wants to dive anyway. You hold the rope ladder and argue with her over the wind."
msgstr "Badai kecil masuk ke teluk. Dia tetap ingin menyelam. Kamu memegangi tangga tali dan berdebat dengannya, berteriak melawan angin."

msgid "A tall beeswax candle with a nine-hour wick. It burns longer if nobody blows it out."
msgstr "Lilin lebah tinggi dengan sumbu sembilan jam. Menyala lebih lama kalau tidak ada yang meniupnya."

msgid "A tip"
msgstr "Tips"

msgid "A twig drops, very precisely, into your lunch."
msgstr "Sebatang ranting jatuh, dengan sangat tepat, ke makan siangmu."

msgid "A wave over the pier"
msgstr "Ombak menerjang dermaga"

msgid "ACHIEVEMENT UNLOCKED"
msgstr "PENCAPAIAN TERBUKA"

msgid "About the voices"
msgstr "Tentang suara"

msgid "About your reward. Last night was not the reward. I need you to understand that. Last night was separate."
msgstr "Soal hadiahmu. Semalam itu bukan hadiahnya. Kamu harus mengerti itu. Semalam itu hal lain."

msgid "Absorb"
msgstr "Serap"

msgid "Absorb!"
msgstr "Serap!"

msgid "Achievements"
msgstr "Pencapaian"

msgid "Ad privacy choices"
msgstr "Privasi iklan"

msgid "Admit it. You like having me around."
msgstr "Ngaku saja. Kamu suka ada aku di dekatmu."

msgid "After Hours"
msgstr "Lewat Jam Tutup"

msgid "After each chapter you pick a reply. A warm one starts her next chapter with bonus points (two extra moves when the chapter is only her goal); a teasing one costs a few points, but she likes those too."
msgstr "Setelah setiap bab kamu memilih jawaban. Jawaban yang hangat memulai bab berikutnya dengan poin bonus (dua langkah tambahan kalau babnya hanya berisi targetnya); jawaban yang menggoda mengurangi sedikit poin, tapi dia juga suka itu."

msgid "After that, her favourite gem shows up more often in all her chapters, for good."
msgstr "Setelah itu, permata favoritnya lebih sering muncul di semua babnya, selamanya."

msgid "After the comb, it can be a big thing."
msgstr "Setelah sisirnya ketemu, boleh dibesar-besarkan."

msgid "Afterwards she lies with her head on your chest, her tail curled down the slipway into the water, flicking now and then."
msgstr "Setelahnya dia berbaring dengan kepala di dadamu, ekornya melingkar menuruni landasan perahu sampai ke air, sesekali berkedut."

msgid "Afterwards she's spread across most of the bed and some of you, glowing faintly, humming something Ambrose used to whistle."
msgstr "Setelahnya dia terhampar di sebagian besar ranjang dan sebagian dirimu, bercahaya samar, menyenandungkan lagu yang dulu sering disiulkan Ambrose."

msgid "Afterwards you lie in the moss with her hair across your chest. Overhead, every leaf on her east side has turned pale side up, the way they do before a storm. There's no storm."
msgstr "Setelahnya kamu berbaring di lumut dengan rambutnya melintang di dadamu. Di atas, setiap daun di sisi timurnya sudah berbalik memperlihatkan sisi pucatnya, seperti sebelum badai. Tidak ada badai."

msgid "Again. Up slow, down hard. Each time she lands, she clenches and holds you for a heartbeat."
msgstr "Lagi. Naik pelan, turun keras. Setiap kali mendarat, dia mengencang dan menahanmu selama satu detak jantung."

msgid "Against an alchemist? You sold my buttons for two coppers and bought them back for six."
msgstr "Melawan alkemis? Kamu menjual kancingku dua keping tembaga dan membelinya lagi enam."

msgid "Ahh!"
msgstr "Ahh!"

msgid "Alchemists boil slimes down for glue. Did you know that? Twelve shillings a pound."
msgstr "Para alkemis merebus lendir jadi lem. Kamu tahu? Dua belas shilling per pon."

msgid "All rules"
msgstr "Semua aturan"

msgid "All spring, by hand? I guess I'll have to get used to you."
msgstr "Sepanjang musim semi, dengan tangan? Kurasa aku harus membiasakan diri denganmu."

msgid "All the girls"
msgstr "Semua gadis"

msgid "Amara Duskrose"
msgstr "Amara Duskrose"

msgid "Amara's power: Correct Lines"
msgstr "Kekuatan Amara: Garis Koreksi"

msgid "Amara's seals broken"
msgstr "Segel Amara dipecahkan"

msgid "Amara. It's the one I use. The real one is in the book, along with everything else that keeps me on a leash."
msgstr "Amara. Itu nama yang kupakai. Nama asliku ada di buku itu, bersama semua hal lain yang membuatku terikat."

msgid "Amara: break every seal"
msgstr "Amara: pecahkan semua segel"

msgid "Amara: sealed pages"
msgstr "Amara: halaman bersegel"

msgid "Ambrose wrote that label. He was the forester. When the alchemists came round buying slimes, he hid me out here. It worked for thirty-one years."
msgstr "Ambrose yang menulis label itu. Dia penjaga hutan. Waktu para alkemis datang membeli lendir, dia menyembunyikanku di sini. Itu berhasil selama tiga puluh satu tahun."

msgid "An owl startles her"
msgstr "Burung hantu mengagetkannya"

msgid "And this time, take your clothes off before you jump in."
msgstr "Dan kali ini, lepas bajumu sebelum melompat."

msgid "And you still haven't asked me for anything."
msgstr "Dan kamu masih belum meminta apa-apa dariku."

msgid "And you're not going to tell anyone either, are you, lifeguard?"
msgstr "Dan kamu juga tidak akan memberi tahu siapa-siapa, kan, penyelamat?"

msgid "Another date"
msgstr "Kencan lagi"

msgid "Another slow slide. The moss above her slit brushes you, soft and damp."
msgstr "Satu luncuran pelan lagi. Lumut di atas celahnya menyapumu, lembut dan lembap."

msgid "Any valid match instantly clears the chapter goal, and grants 99 stars — for QA, not for actually playing."
msgstr "Kecocokan apa pun langsung menyelesaikan target bab dan memberi 99 bintang — untuk pengujian, bukan untuk bermain sungguhan."

msgid "Anything you've bought on this Google account comes back in a moment."
msgstr "Semua yang kamu beli dengan akun Google ini akan kembali sebentar lagi."

msgid "At the Midsummer Tide the whole family swims out to the rocks, and Gran wears nine pearls in her hair and pretends not to notice everyone watching her."
msgstr "Saat Pasang Tengah Musim Panas seluruh keluarga berenang ke bebatuan, dan Nenek memakai sembilan mutiara di rambutnya, pura-pura tidak sadar semua orang memandanginya."

msgid "Auto"
msgstr "Otomatis"

msgid "Auto Speed"
msgstr "Kecepatan Otomatis"

msgid "Avalanche"
msgstr "Longsor"

msgid "BLOSSOMS"
msgstr "BUNGA"

msgid "Back"
msgstr "Kembali"

msgid "Back to the chapter"
msgstr "Kembali ke bab"

msgid "Back to the roster"
msgstr "Kembali ke lingkaran"

msgid "Balanced route"
msgstr "Rute Seimbang"

msgid "Best chapter score"
msgstr "Skor bab terbaik"

msgid "Best combo"
msgstr "Kombo terbaik"

msgid "Best daily challenge"
msgstr "Tantangan harian terbaik"

msgid "Best date with %s"
msgstr "Kencan terbaik dengan %s"

msgid "Best value"
msgstr "Paling hemat"

msgid "Better than the last one the miller sent."
msgstr "Lebih baik dari yang terakhir dikirim tukang giling."

msgid "Between the roots of an old oak, someone has dug a little hollow and lined it with moss. In it sits a big glass jar, sealed with wax. The label says PICKLED NEWTS, DO NOT OPEN, in handwriting that's trying to be funny."
msgstr "Di antara akar pohon ek tua, seseorang menggali lekukan kecil dan melapisinya dengan lumut. Di dalamnya ada stoples kaca besar, disegel dengan lilin. Labelnya bertuliskan KADAL AIR ACAR, JANGAN DIBUKA, dengan tulisan tangan yang berusaha lucu."

msgid "Bigger text everywhere: dialogue, menus and the puzzle."
msgstr "Teks lebih besar di mana-mana: dialog, menu, dan teka-teki."

msgid "Black cover. No title. It'll feel warm. Don't open it."
msgstr "Sampul hitam. Tanpa judul. Terasa hangat. Jangan dibuka."

msgid "Blossom! +%d"
msgstr "Bunga! +%d"

msgid "Blossom."
msgstr "Mekar."

msgid "Blossoms"
msgstr "Bunga"

msgid "Board, lifeguard. Not me."
msgstr "Mata ke papan, penyelamat. Bukan ke aku."

msgid "Boathouse. It's got a door. Gran can't see through doors. Probably."
msgstr "Gudang perahu. Ada pintunya. Nenek tidak bisa melihat menembus pintu. Mungkin."

msgid "Bookbinder"
msgstr "Penjilid Buku"

msgid "Boom!"
msgstr "Duar!"

msgid "Brambles underfoot"
msgstr "Semak berduri di bawah kaki"

msgid "Brass Pocket Sundial"
msgstr "Jam Matahari Saku Kuningan"

msgid "Break 50 of Amara's seals."
msgstr "Pecahkan 50 segel Amara."

msgid "Bring 10 comb pieces up for Marina."
msgstr "Angkat 10 kepingan sisir untuk Marina."

msgid "But I'll allow it. Bring the shovel tomorrow though."
msgstr "Tapi akan kumaafkan. Bawa sekop besok, ya."

msgid "But she's a little pinker than she was."
msgstr "Tapi dia sedikit lebih merah muda dari sebelumnya."

msgid "Buy"
msgstr "Beli"

msgid "Buy something in the Item Shop."
msgstr "Beli sesuatu di Toko Item."

msgid "Buy · %d"
msgstr "Beli · %d"

msgid "Buy · %d ⭐"
msgstr "Beli · %d ⭐"

msgid "By the end of the month the old wall has stopped cracking. The new millrace runs clean, and Aldous Brock stands on the bank for a long time with his hat in his hands."
msgstr "Pada akhir bulan, dinding lama itu berhenti retak. Saluran kincir yang baru mengalir jernih, dan Aldous Brock berdiri lama di tepian dengan topi di tangan."

msgid "By two in the morning you've checked every book returned this month. No black cover. One very overdue cookbook, which she opens, reads a page of, and closes in disgust."
msgstr "Pukul dua pagi kamu sudah memeriksa semua buku yang dikembalikan bulan ini. Tidak ada sampul hitam. Ada satu buku masak yang sangat terlambat, yang dia buka, baca satu halaman, lalu tutup dengan jijik."

msgid "C-can I sleep in your room tonight? Not in the jar. With you."
msgstr "B-boleh aku tidur di kamarmu malam ini? Bukan di stoples. Bersamamu."

msgid "CHAPTER GOAL"
msgstr "TARGET BAB"

msgid "COMB PIECES"
msgstr "KEPINGAN SISIR"

msgid "COMING UP"
msgstr "SEGERA"

msgid "Can we not? Please?"
msgstr "Bisa tidak usah? Tolong?"

msgid "Can you... turn the lamp down a bit?"
msgstr "Bisa... kecilkan lampunya sedikit?"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Batal"

msgid "Careful. If you keep staring at me like that, I'll start thinking you summoned me on purpose."
msgstr "Hati-hati. Kalau kamu terus menatapku seperti itu, aku bisa mengira kamu sengaja memanggilku."

msgid "Carry on without clearing this chapter (no stars for it)."
msgstr "Lanjutkan tanpa menyelesaikan bab ini (tanpa bintang)."

msgid "Chain Reaction"
msgstr "Reaksi Berantai"

msgid "Chapter %d / %d"
msgstr "Bab %d / %d"

msgid "Chapter %d · +%d"
msgstr "Bab %d · +%d"

msgid "Chapter %d · +%d ⭐"
msgstr "Bab %d · +%d ⭐"

msgid "Chapter cleared!"
msgstr "Bab selesai!"

msgid "Chapters cleared"
msgstr "Bab selesai"

msgid "Charm Burst"
msgstr "Ledakan Pesona"

msgid "Charm Burst! +150"
msgstr "Ledakan Pesona! +150"

msgid "Charm Combo is for adults"
msgstr "Charm Combo untuk orang dewasa"

msgid "Charm halved"
msgstr "Pesona terpotong setengah"

msgid "Charm — fills as you match (her favorite gem fastest). Full = +150 Charm Burst."
msgstr "Pesona — terisi saat kamu mencocokkan (paling cepat dengan permata favoritnya). Penuh = Ledakan Pesona +150."

msgid "Charm — fills as you match (her favourite gem fastest). Full = one use of her power: %s"
msgstr "Pesona — terisi saat kamu mencocokkan (paling cepat dengan permata favoritnya). Penuh = satu kali pakai kekuatannya: %s"

msgid "Chest of Stars"
msgstr "Peti Bintang"

msgid "Chimes for matches, combos, and menus."
msgstr "Denting untuk kecocokan, kombo, dan menu."

msgid "Choose"
msgstr "Pilih"

msgid "Clean lines. I'm almost proud of you."
msgstr "Garisnya rapi. Aku hampir bangga padamu."

msgid "Clear Hazel's first chapter."
msgstr "Selesaikan bab pertama Hazel."

msgid "Clear Hazel's second chapter."
msgstr "Selesaikan bab kedua Hazel."

msgid "Clear Hazel's third chapter."
msgstr "Selesaikan bab ketiga Hazel."

msgid "Clear a chapter with 5 or more moves left."
msgstr "Selesaikan bab dengan sisa 5 langkah atau lebih."

msgid "Clear a cursed shard with the Hammer."
msgstr "Hancurkan pecahan terkutuk dengan Palu."

msgid "Clear all the way through. Like me."
msgstr "Bening sampai tembus. Seperti aku."

msgid "Clear any chapter to unlock the daily challenge."
msgstr "Selesaikan bab mana saja untuk membuka tantangan harian."

msgid "Clear the moss to find her things: buttons, marbles, keys, the glass eye. Find enough of them to win."
msgstr "Bersihkan lumut untuk menemukan barang-barangnya: kancing, kelereng, kunci, mata kaca. Temukan cukup banyak untuk menang."

msgid "Click to view."
msgstr "Klik untuk melihat."

msgid "Click, Space or Enter: next line. Hold Ctrl or press Skip: skip lines you've read. A or Auto: lines play on by themselves. L, Log or scroll up: read back. H: hide the text on full-screen pictures. Text speed is in Settings."
msgstr "Klik, Spasi atau Enter: baris berikutnya. Tahan Ctrl atau tekan Lewati: lewati baris yang sudah dibaca. A atau Otomatis: baris berjalan sendiri. L, Riwayat atau gulir ke atas: baca ulang. H: sembunyikan teks pada gambar layar penuh. Kecepatan teks ada di Pengaturan."

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Tutup"

msgid "Close enough."
msgstr "Lumayan."

msgid "Close enough. You can keep using it."
msgstr "Lumayan. Kamu boleh terus memakainya."

msgid "Close settings"
msgstr "Tutup pengaturan"

msgid "Comb pieces"
msgstr "Kepingan sisir"

msgid "Comb pieces brought up"
msgstr "Kepingan sisir diangkat"

msgid "Comb pieces rise when the gems above them clear."
msgstr "Kepingan sisir naik saat permata di atasnya dibersihkan."

msgid "Combo x%d!"
msgstr "Kombo x%d!"

msgid "Combos"
msgstr "Kombo"

msgid "Come here. That's an order, and I'm only giving it once before I come over there and get you."
msgstr "Kemari. Itu perintah, dan aku hanya memberikannya sekali sebelum aku sendiri yang datang menjemputmu."

msgid "Come on. Binders keep ledgers. If he sold them, he wrote down who to."
msgstr "Ayo. Penjilid buku mencatat di buku besar. Kalau dia menjualnya, dia menulis siapa pembelinya."

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Lanjutkan"

msgid "Continue the story  ▸"
msgstr "Lanjutkan cerita  ▸"

msgid "Continue with %s"
msgstr "Lanjutkan dengan %s"

msgid "Correct Lines"
msgstr "Garis Koreksi"

msgid "Correct Lines!"
msgstr "Garis Koreksi!"

msgid "Credits"
msgstr "Kredit"

msgid "Crystal"
msgstr "Kristal"

msgid "Crystal. I'd keep that one."
msgstr "Kristal. Yang itu akan kusimpan."

msgid "Cursed Shard"
msgstr "Pecahan Terkutuk"

msgid "Cursed shards"
msgstr "Pecahan terkutuk"

msgid "Daily challenge"
msgstr "Tantangan harian"

msgid "Daily challenge: %d pts"
msgstr "Tantangan harian: %d poin"

msgid "Dark, cracked shards cost you points when they're part of a match. The Hammer smashes one for free."
msgstr "Pecahan gelap yang retak mengurangi poinmu kalau ikut dalam kecocokan. Palu bisa menghancurkannya gratis."

msgid "Day four. Word's got round that someone is digging by the old hazel instead of cutting it down. The miller's daughter brings you lunch, and you walk her back as far as the footbridge."
msgstr "Hari keempat. Kabar sudah menyebar bahwa ada yang menggali di dekat pohon hazel tua alih-alih menebangnya. Putri tukang giling membawakanmu makan siang, dan kamu mengantarnya kembali sampai jembatan kecil."

msgid "Day three. She's been in the water since dawn, and she misses the rope ladder twice trying to climb onto the pier. At the far end, three old fishermen are setting out their Thursday tile game by lamplight."
msgstr "Hari ketiga. Dia sudah di air sejak subuh dan dua kali gagal meraih tangga tali saat mencoba naik ke dermaga. Di ujung lain, tiga nelayan tua menyiapkan permainan kerikil hari Kamis mereka di bawah cahaya lentera."

msgid "Dead leaves come down"
msgstr "Daun kering berguguran"

msgid "Dialogue controls"
msgstr "Kontrol dialog"

msgid "Difficulty"
msgstr "Tingkat Kesulitan"

msgid "Dig faster. I'd like to see another spring."
msgstr "Gali lebih cepat. Aku ingin melihat musim semi berikutnya."

msgid "Dig your trench. Sleeves up!"
msgstr "Gali paritmu. Gulung lengan baju!"

msgid "Dislikes"
msgstr "Tidak suka"

msgid "Do that again. Slower."
msgstr "Lakukan lagi. Lebih pelan."

msgid "Don't Even Think About It"
msgstr "Jangan Coba-Coba"

msgid "Don't even think about it."
msgstr "Jangan coba-coba."

msgid "Don't go before morning. I'll know if you do. I'll hear the door."
msgstr "Jangan pergi sebelum pagi. Aku akan tahu kalau kamu pergi. Aku akan dengar pintunya."

msgid "Don't look at them. They're not for you. They're seasonal."
msgstr "Jangan lihat itu. Itu bukan untukmu. Itu musiman."

msgid "Don't look so pleased with yourself. Actually, no. Look exactly that pleased."
msgstr "Jangan kelihatan begitu puas dengan dirimu. Eh, tidak. Kelihatan persis sepuas itu."

msgid "Don't put me back in the jar yet. I want to go home on my own. Well. Not walk. You know."
msgstr "Jangan masukkan aku ke stoples dulu. Aku mau pulang sendiri. Yah. Tidak jalan kaki. Kamu tahu maksudku."

msgid "Don't say it like that. Like it matters."
msgstr "Jangan bilang begitu. Seolah itu berarti."

msgid "Don't. Don't you dare."
msgstr "Jangan. Jangan berani-berani."

msgid "Don't. Just don't."
msgstr "Jangan. Pokoknya jangan."

msgid "Don't... look at me like that."
msgstr "Jangan... menatapku begitu."

msgid "Down on the pier, a whole family is yelling at the water. Out past the rocks, a woman is floating face up, perfectly still, her hair spread out round her."
msgstr "Di bawah, di dermaga, satu keluarga berteriak ke arah air. Di balik bebatuan, seorang wanita mengapung telentang, diam sama sekali, rambutnya terurai di sekelilingnya."

msgid "Dryad of the old hazel"
msgstr "Dryad pohon hazel tua"

msgid "Dust off the top shelf"
msgstr "Debu jatuh dari rak paling atas"

msgid "Each chapter has a goal and a number of moves. At first it's points; from her third chapter it's something of hers to do on the board, and in her last both. Reach it before your moves run out and the story carries on. There's no timer: take as long as you like."
msgstr "Setiap bab punya target dan jumlah langkah. Awalnya poin; mulai bab ketiganya, ada sesuatu yang harus dilakukan untuknya di papan, dan di bab terakhir keduanya. Capai sebelum langkahmu habis dan ceritanya berlanjut. Tidak ada batas waktu: santai saja."

msgid "Each kind of gem shows a number, so you don't need colour to tell them apart."
msgstr "Setiap jenis permata menampilkan nomor, jadi kamu tidak perlu warna untuk membedakannya."

msgid "Easy"
msgstr "Mudah"

msgid "Eat your lunch. I'm sure her bread is very good. I wouldn't know."
msgstr "Makan siangmu. Aku yakin rotinya enak sekali. Aku tidak tahu."

msgid "Ember"
msgstr "Bara"

msgid "End the date"
msgstr "Akhiri kencan"

msgid "End this date and see your score."
msgstr "Akhiri kencan ini dan lihat skormu."

msgid "Ending Gallery"
msgstr "Galeri Akhir Cerita"

msgid "Ending: %s"
msgstr "Akhir: %s"

msgid "Endings"
msgstr "Akhir cerita"

msgid "Every Day Counts"
msgstr "Setiap Hari Berarti"

msgid "Every few moves something happens around you: the panel on her side says what and when. It might raise what it takes to win her over, turn gems into cursed shards, cost you a move or halve your Charm ring. Matching her favourite gem holds it off a move; a Charm Burst clears it."
msgstr "Setiap beberapa langkah, sesuatu terjadi di sekitar kalian: panel di sisinya memberi tahu apa dan kapan. Bisa menaikkan syarat untuk memikatnya, mengubah permata jadi pecahan terkutuk, mengurangi satu langkah, atau memotong setengah cincin Pesonamu. Mencocokkan permata favoritnya menundanya satu langkah; Ledakan Pesona membatalkannya."

msgid "Every girl has a favourite gem and one she dislikes (on her card in the roster, and at the top of her side in a chapter). Her favourite scores double and fills the Charm ring faster; the one she dislikes scores half."
msgstr "Setiap gadis punya permata favorit dan satu yang tidak dia suka (di kartunya di lingkaran, dan di bagian atas sisinya saat bab berlangsung). Permata favoritnya bernilai ganda dan mengisi cincin Pesona lebih cepat; yang tidak dia suka bernilai setengah."

msgid "Every match fills the Charm ring. In a girl's first chapter a full ring is a Charm Burst: +150 points. From her second chapter it's one use of her own power instead: its button lights up next to the ring, use it when you like. The ring fills again after."
msgstr "Setiap kecocokan mengisi cincin Pesona. Di bab pertama seorang gadis, cincin penuh berarti Ledakan Pesona: +150 poin. Mulai bab keduanya, cincin penuh berarti satu kali pakai kekuatannya sendiri: tombolnya menyala di samping cincin, pakai kapan saja. Setelah itu cincin terisi lagi."

msgid "Every one of those pages is part of my binding. Somebody has been buying them."
msgstr "Setiap halaman itu bagian dari ikatanku. Ada yang membelinya."

msgid "Every one? That's four hundred and twelve buttons."
msgstr "Semuanya? Itu empat ratus dua belas kancing."

msgid "Every seed and sprout on the board grows one stage."
msgstr "Setiap benih dan tunas di papan tumbuh satu tahap."

msgid "Everyone keeps asking about the comb and I'm running out of excuses."
msgstr "Semua orang terus bertanya soal sisir itu, dan alasanku mulai habis."

msgid "Everything — music and sound effects."
msgstr "Semuanya — musik dan efek suara."

msgid "Ex-excuse me. That's my eye. I mean... It's in my collection. I'd like it back, please."
msgstr "P-permisi. Itu mataku. Maksudku... Itu bagian dari koleksiku. Aku ingin memintanya kembali."

msgid "Eyes on the board. I'll still be here."
msgstr "Mata ke papan. Aku tidak akan ke mana-mana."

msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Cepat"

msgid "Faster. And alphabetise properly. I've seen your circle."
msgstr "Lebih cepat. Dan urutkan abjad dengan benar. Aku sudah lihat lingkaranmu."

msgid "Faster. Tide's turning."
msgstr "Lebih cepat. Air pasangnya berbalik."

msgid "Fill the Charm ring for a Charm Burst."
msgstr "Isi cincin Pesona untuk Ledakan Pesona."

msgid "Fill the ring"
msgstr "Isi cincinnya"

msgid "Fill the whole screen. F11 toggles it anywhere."
msgstr "Penuhi seluruh layar. F11 mengubahnya di mana saja."

msgid "Find 30 of Opal's lost things under the moss."
msgstr "Temukan 30 barang Opal yang hilang di bawah lumut."

msgid "Finders Keepers"
msgstr "Siapa Cepat Dia Dapat"

msgid "Fine. They're for you. I haven't flowered out of season since before the mill was built. The animals are going to talk."
msgstr "Baiklah. Itu untukmu. Aku belum pernah berbunga di luar musim sejak sebelum kincir dibangun. Hewan-hewan pasti bergosip."

msgid "Fine. You're not a menace anymore. You can help me. Don't get excited."
msgstr "Baiklah. Kamu bukan pengganggu lagi. Kamu boleh membantuku. Jangan senang dulu."

msgid "Finish Hazel's story picking every warm reply."
msgstr "Selesaikan cerita Hazel dengan selalu memilih jawaban hangat."

msgid "Finish Hazel's story teasing her in every reply."
msgstr "Selesaikan cerita Hazel dengan menggodanya di setiap jawaban."

msgid "Finish a daily challenge."
msgstr "Selesaikan tantangan harian."

msgid "Fire. In a grove. Really?"
msgstr "Api. Di dalam hutan kecil. Serius?"

msgid "Flattery. Good. Keep going."
msgstr "Rayuan. Bagus. Lanjutkan."

msgid "For bug reports: send the newest godot.log from this folder."
msgstr "Untuk laporan bug: kirim godot.log terbaru dari folder ini."

msgid "For sticking with it: a free Time Scroll!"
msgstr "Karena pantang menyerah: Gulungan Waktu gratis!"

msgid "For the record: four hundred-odd summonings, several kings and one very enthusiastic bishop. None of them came close. I'm only telling you once."
msgstr "Sebagai catatan: empat ratusan pemanggilan, beberapa raja, dan satu uskup yang sangat bersemangat. Tidak ada yang mendekati. Aku hanya mengatakannya sekali."

msgid "Forty years, I said. Mind where you swing."
msgstr "Empat puluh tahun, kubilang. Hati-hati kalau mengayun."

msgid "Found under the moss: %s"
msgstr "Ditemukan di bawah lumut: %s"

msgid "Four hundred and twelve buttons, twenty-six keys, a glass eye and two owls. The alchemist's men are felling the north woods now, so Opal is staying with you, and her collection takes up a whole shelf in your front room. She rearranges it twice."
msgstr "Empat ratus dua belas kancing, dua puluh enam kunci, satu mata kaca, dan dua burung hantu. Orang-orang si alkemis sedang menebang hutan utara sekarang, jadi Opal tinggal bersamamu, dan koleksinya memenuhi satu rak penuh di ruang depanmu. Dia menatanya ulang dua kali."

msgid "Four hundred and twelve buttons. Twenty-six keys. A glass eye. Everyone who comes through these woods drops something, and I kept it."
msgstr "Empat ratus dua belas kancing. Dua puluh enam kunci. Satu mata kaca. Setiap orang yang lewat hutan ini menjatuhkan sesuatu, dan aku menyimpannya."

msgid "Four hundred buttons is a lot of strangers' buttons."
msgstr "Empat ratus kancing itu banyak sekali kancing orang asing."

msgid "Free date"
msgstr "Kencan bebas"

msgid "Free stars"
msgstr "Bintang gratis"

msgid "Free: %s"
msgstr "Gratis: %s"

msgid "Frosted Sea-Glass Pendant"
msgstr "Liontin Kaca Laut Buram"

msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "Layar Penuh"

msgid "Gallery"
msgstr "Galeri"

msgid "Gem numbers"
msgstr "Nomor permata"

msgid "Gems cleared"
msgstr "Permata dibersihkan"

msgid "Gently. Like that."
msgstr "Pelan-pelan. Begitu."

msgid "Get that holy rock away from me."
msgstr "Jauhkan batu suci itu dariku."

msgid "Girls"
msgstr "Gadis"

msgid "Give Hazel the Brass Pocket Sundial."
msgstr "Berikan Hazel Jam Matahari Saku Kuningan."

msgid "Give her the %s"
msgstr "Berikan padanya: %s"

msgid "Gold swirl. They stopped making these before I went in the jar. Where did you even find it?"
msgstr "Pilinan emas. Mereka sudah berhenti membuatnya sebelum aku masuk stoples. Dari mana kamu menemukannya?"

msgid "Google Play isn't reachable right now. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Google Play sedang tidak bisa dijangkau. Coba lagi sebentar lagi."

msgid "Got it"
msgstr "Mengerti"

msgid "Gran at the Midsummer Tide, her pearl comb in her hair."
msgstr "Nenek saat Pasang Tengah Musim Panas, sisir mutiaranya di rambut."

msgid "Gran wears the comb at the Midsummer Tide and never finds out it was lost. Marina tells her anyway, a month later, and Gran laughs so hard she has to be helped onto a rock. Marina tells the story of how you met at every family dinner after that, and it gets bigger every time. Gran corrects her every time, and every time she sets a place for you without asking."
msgstr "Nenek memakai sisir itu saat Pasang Tengah Musim Panas dan tidak pernah tahu sisir itu sempat hilang. Marina tetap menceritakannya sebulan kemudian, dan Nenek tertawa begitu keras sampai harus dibantu naik ke batu. Sejak itu Marina menceritakan pertemuan kalian di setiap makan malam keluarga, dan ceritanya makin besar setiap kali. Setiap kali Nenek mengoreksinya, dan setiap kali dia menyiapkan tempat untukmu tanpa ditanya."

msgid "Gran's asked you to the family dinner, which is not a small thing, people have married into this family and never been asked to the family dinner."
msgstr "Nenek mengundangmu makan malam keluarga, dan itu bukan hal kecil: ada orang yang menikah masuk keluarga ini dan tidak pernah diundang makan malam keluarga."

msgid "Gran's going to know. She always knows. She's going to look at me over breakfast and just know."
msgstr "Nenek pasti tahu. Dia selalu tahu. Dia akan menatapku waktu sarapan dan langsung tahu."

msgid "Gran's going to wear it at the Tide and never know. Nobody's ever going to know you did this."
msgstr "Nenek akan memakainya saat Pasang dan tidak akan pernah tahu. Tidak ada yang akan tahu kamu melakukan ini."

msgid "Gran, I'm fine. I'm always like that."
msgstr "Nek, aku baik-baik saja. Aku memang selalu begini."

msgid "Greedy. Oh, so you'll make him pay you to help me? I like that."
msgstr "Rakus. Oh, jadi kamu akan membuatnya membayarmu untuk membantuku? Aku suka itu."

msgid "Grow 25 of Hazel's blossoms."
msgstr "Mekarkan 25 bunga Hazel."

msgid "Grow enough seeds into blossoms to win. A new seed drops in every few moves."
msgstr "Tumbuhkan cukup banyak benih jadi bunga untuk menang. Benih baru jatuh setiap beberapa langkah."

msgid "Hah... ah... yes. Like that. With me."
msgstr "Hah... ah... iya. Begitu. Bersamaku."

msgid "Hammer"
msgstr "Palu"

msgid "Hand-Dipped Beeswax Candle"
msgstr "Lilin Lebah Celup Tangan"

msgid "Handful of Stars"
msgstr "Segenggam Bintang"

msgid "Hard"
msgstr "Sulit"

msgid "Hard: every few moves something happens on your date (a wave over the pier, the candles gutter), shown in advance. Story difficulty comes with the Story Pass. Takes effect from the next chapter."
msgstr "Sulit: setiap beberapa langkah ada kejadian saat kencanmu (ombak menerjang dermaga, lilin berkedip), diberi tahu lebih dulu. Tingkat Cerita datang bersama Story Pass. Berlaku mulai bab berikutnya."

msgid "Hard: things happen on your date"
msgstr "Sulit: ada kejadian saat kencanmu"

msgid "Hazel Mossgrove"
msgstr "Hazel Mossgrove"

msgid "Hazel's blossoms grown"
msgstr "Bunga Hazel dimekarkan"

msgid "Hazel's power: Summer"
msgstr "Kekuatan Hazel: Musim Panas"

msgid "Hazel: grow blossoms"
msgstr "Hazel: mekarkan bunga"

msgid "Hazel: seeds"
msgstr "Hazel: benih"

msgid "He tells you to keep the money. Then he walks over and pats the hazel's trunk, awkwardly, like a man apologising to a horse."
msgstr "Dia bilang kamu boleh menyimpan uangnya. Lalu dia mendekat dan menepuk batang pohon hazel itu, dengan canggung, seperti pria yang minta maaf pada kuda."

msgid "He took it apart. To sell it page by page."
msgstr "Dia membongkarnya. Untuk dijual halaman demi halaman."

msgid "He used to tap on the glass every morning twice so I'd know it was him."
msgstr "Dia dulu mengetuk kaca dua kali setiap pagi supaya aku tahu itu dia."

msgid "He's never done that. Forty springs, and he's never once done that."
msgstr "Dia belum pernah melakukan itu. Empat puluh musim semi, dan dia sekali pun belum pernah melakukan itu."

msgid "Hear the girls speak their lines."
msgstr "Dengarkan para gadis mengucapkan dialog mereka."

msgid "Hearts left: %d / %d"
msgstr "Sisa hati: %d / %d"

msgid "Hearts: %d / %d"
msgstr "Hati: %d / %d"

msgid "Hearts: losing a chapter costs one, and they come back over time."
msgstr "Hati: kalah dalam satu bab memakan satu, dan hati kembali seiring waktu."

msgid "Her ass comes to rest on you. You're in her to the root."
msgstr "Pantatnya mendarat di atasmu. Kamu di dalamnya sampai ke pangkal."

msgid "Her board with no move limit, just for fun and a high score."
msgstr "Papannya tanpa batas langkah, sekadar untuk bersenang-senang dan mencetak rekor."

msgid "Her corrections in red pencil, all over the loose page that started it."
msgstr "Koreksinya dengan pensil merah, memenuhi halaman lepas yang memulai semuanya."

msgid "Her ending"
msgstr "Akhir ceritanya"

msgid "Her entire family is, in fact, right there. A grandmother, a mother, three sisters. One of the sisters is laughing so hard she can barely ask, out loud, whether Mari is going to thank her lifeguard."
msgstr "Seluruh keluarganya memang ada di situ. Seorang nenek, seorang ibu, tiga saudara perempuan. Salah satunya tertawa begitu keras sampai hampir tidak bisa bertanya keras-keras apakah Mari akan berterima kasih pada penyelamatnya."

msgid "Her family slips off the end of the pier one by one and swims home round the point, very slowly, looking back the whole way. She waits until they're out of earshot."
msgstr "Keluarganya meluncur satu per satu dari ujung dermaga dan berenang pulang mengitari tanjung, sangat pelan, menoleh ke belakang sepanjang jalan. Dia menunggu sampai mereka tidak bisa mendengar."

msgid "Her father came by this morning. He'll give you until the end of the month. Then he hires someone with a saw."
msgstr "Ayahnya datang tadi pagi. Dia memberimu waktu sampai akhir bulan. Setelah itu dia menyewa orang yang membawa gergaji."

msgid "Her favourite gem scores double and fills Charm faster; the one she dislikes scores half."
msgstr "Permata favoritnya bernilai ganda dan mengisi Pesona lebih cepat; yang tidak dia suka bernilai setengah."

msgid "Her gift"
msgstr "Hadiahnya"

msgid "Her gift: more of her favourite gem"
msgstr "Hadiahnya: permata favoritnya lebih sering muncul"

msgid "Her grandmother says, mildly, that they'd been calling her for twenty minutes, that the tide's on the turn, and that this nice person was the only one who did anything about it."
msgstr "Neneknya berkata pelan bahwa mereka sudah memanggilnya dua puluh menit, bahwa air pasang akan segera berbalik, dan bahwa orang baik ini satu-satunya yang berbuat sesuatu."

msgid "Her hands are warm now. They were cold the first time you touched the bark. She sees you notice."
msgstr "Tangannya sekarang hangat. Dulu dingin waktu pertama kali kamu menyentuh kulit kayunya. Dia melihat kamu menyadarinya."

msgid "Her jar sits at the end of the shelf with the lid off. She hasn't been in it for three days."
msgstr "Stoplesnya berdiri di ujung rak tanpa tutup. Sudah tiga hari dia tidak masuk ke dalamnya."

msgid "Her library card has your address on it in small, furious handwriting. She moves in with forty candles and opinions about your bookshelf, which she reorganises by how much she disliked each book. Your favourite goes on the bottom shelf. Most nights she's still at the late desk when your shift ends, and she walks you home by the river even though it's longer."
msgstr "Kartu perpustakaannya mencantumkan alamatmu dengan tulisan kecil yang geram. Dia pindah ke tempatmu dengan empat puluh lilin dan banyak pendapat soal rak bukumu, yang dia tata ulang berdasarkan seberapa dia membenci setiap buku. Buku favoritmu masuk rak paling bawah. Hampir setiap malam dia masih di meja malam saat giliranmu selesai, dan dia mengantarmu pulang lewat tepi sungai meskipun lebih jauh."

msgid "Her night scene"
msgstr "Adegan malamnya"

msgid "Her powers used"
msgstr "Kekuatan dipakai"

msgid "Her rhythm breaks. She's only grinding now, hard and desperate, with you buried as deep as you'll go."
msgstr "Iramanya pecah. Sekarang dia hanya menggiling, keras dan putus asa, denganmu terbenam sedalam mungkin."

msgid "Her sap runs down your shaft and over your balls, warm as bathwater."
msgstr "Getahnya mengalir menuruni batangmu dan membasahi buah zakarmu, hangat seperti air mandi."

msgid "Her sisters start watching"
msgstr "Saudara-saudaranya mulai menonton"

msgid "Her story carries on as if you'd cleared it. You don't get its stars."
msgstr "Ceritanya berlanjut seolah kamu sudah menyelesaikannya. Kamu tidak mendapat bintangnya."

msgid "Her story starts over from your first meeting, so you can make different choices. Endings you've found stay in the Gallery, your gift stays given, and her chapters pay out stars again."
msgstr "Ceritanya dimulai lagi dari pertemuan pertama kalian, jadi kamu bisa membuat pilihan berbeda. Akhir cerita yang sudah ditemukan tetap di Galeri, hadiahmu tetap terberi, dan bab-babnya memberi bintang lagi."

msgid "Her thighs are trembling under your hands. Small aftershocks still flutter through her."
msgstr "Pahanya gemetar di bawah tanganmu. Getaran-getaran kecil masih berdesir di tubuhnya."

msgid "Hide text"
msgstr "Sembunyikan teks"

msgid "High Tide"
msgstr "Air Pasang"

msgid "High Tide!"
msgstr "Air Pasang!"

msgid "High Water"
msgstr "Air Pasang Tinggi"

msgid "Hnn...!"
msgstr "Hnn...!"

msgid "Hold still. I want to do this part."
msgstr "Diam saja. Bagian ini aku yang mau melakukannya."

msgid "Home"
msgstr "Beranda"

msgid "How fast dialogue types out."
msgstr "Seberapa cepat dialog muncul."

msgid "How long Auto waits after each line (left = quicker)."
msgstr "Berapa lama Otomatis menunggu setelah setiap baris (kiri = lebih cepat)."

msgid "How long have you been out here on your own?"
msgstr "Sudah berapa lama kamu sendirian di sini?"

msgid "How loud the background music plays."
msgstr "Seberapa keras musik latar diputar."

msgid "How loud their voices play."
msgstr "Seberapa keras suara mereka."

msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "Cara Bermain"

msgid "Huh. Nobody's ever told me to slow down. They just assume I've got it handled."
msgstr "Hm. Belum pernah ada yang menyuruhku pelan-pelan. Semua orang menganggap aku bisa menanganinya."

msgid "I can walk as far as my roots go. They go a long way now. Thanks to someone."
msgstr "Aku bisa berjalan sejauh akarku menjalar. Sekarang akarku menjalar jauh. Berkat seseorang."

msgid "I destroyed kingdoms, and you're making me wait?!"
msgstr "Aku menghancurkan kerajaan-kerajaan, dan kamu menyuruhku menunggu?!"

msgid "I did that. Did you see? I did that out loud."
msgstr "Aku yang melakukannya. Kamu lihat? Aku mengatakannya keras-keras."

msgid "I don't like those. Sorry."
msgstr "Aku tidak suka yang itu. Maaf."

msgid "I had to drop a branch on the last guy, but don't worry, your face is too nice."
msgstr "Yang terakhir terpaksa kujatuhi dahan, tapi jangan khawatir, wajahmu terlalu tampan."

msgid "I have to tell you something. I kept something of yours. On the first day."
msgstr "Aku harus memberitahumu sesuatu. Aku menyimpan sesuatu milikmu. Di hari pertama."

msgid "I know about the wall. My roots go where the water is. I can't control it."
msgstr "Aku tahu soal dinding itu. Akarku tumbuh ke arah air. Aku tidak bisa mengendalikannya."

msgid "I know. You were still gone forty minutes, not that I was counting."
msgstr "Aku tahu. Tetap saja kamu pergi empat puluh menit, bukan berarti aku menghitung."

msgid "I like having someone to hold the bucket."
msgstr "Aku suka ada yang memegangi ember."

msgid "I lose things. You've noticed. I'm not losing this one."
msgstr "Aku sering menghilangkan barang. Kamu sudah sadar. Yang ini tidak akan kuhilangkan."

msgid "I should tell you I don't know what I'm doing. I've only heard about this. Through glass. People say a lot on a forest path when they think no one's listening."
msgstr "Aku harus bilang aku tidak tahu apa yang kulakukan. Aku cuma pernah dengar soal ini. Lewat kaca. Orang bicara banyak di jalan setapak hutan kalau mereka kira tidak ada yang mendengar."

msgid "I still owe you a reward. I haven't decided what it is yet. Don't look at me like that, I'm deciding."
msgstr "Aku masih berutang hadiah padamu. Aku belum memutuskan apa. Jangan menatapku begitu, aku sedang memutuskan."

msgid "I was fine. It was quiet in there."
msgstr "Aku baik-baik saja. Di dalam sana tenang."

msgid "I was floating. On my back. I'm a mermaid, if you didn't notice, and you just dragged me out of my own cove in front of my entire family."
msgstr "Aku sedang mengapung. Telentang. Aku putri duyung, kalau kamu belum sadar, dan kamu baru saja menyeretku keluar dari teluk milikku sendiri di depan seluruh keluargaku."

msgid "I was meant to get it cleaned. I dropped it off the pier a week ago. Nobody knows."
msgstr "Aku seharusnya membawanya untuk dibersihkan. Seminggu lalu sisir itu jatuh dari dermaga. Tidak ada yang tahu."

msgid "I wasn't resting. I was looking for something. Gran's pearl comb. It's the only thing she brought with her when she came to this cove, and she wears it every Midsummer Tide."
msgstr "Aku tidak sedang beristirahat. Aku sedang mencari sesuatu. Sisir mutiara Nenek. Itu satu-satunya barang yang dia bawa waktu datang ke teluk ini, dan dia memakainya setiap tahun saat Pasang Tengah Musim Panas."

msgid "I won't tell. Let me help you look."
msgstr "Aku tidak akan bilang. Biar aku bantu mencari."

msgid "I'd do it badly. Out of spite."
msgstr "Akan kulakukan dengan buruk. Karena dendam."

msgid "I'd like to do it again. That's allowed to be said, isn't it? Good. I'd like to do it again."
msgstr "Aku ingin melakukannya lagi. Boleh dikatakan, kan? Bagus. Aku ingin melakukannya lagi."

msgid "I'd like to make it a thing."
msgstr "Aku ingin membesar-besarkannya."

msgid "I'd like to see that, actually."
msgstr "Sebenarnya aku ingin melihat itu."

msgid "I'd want my own jar. Just to start. Is that strange?"
msgstr "Aku mau stoples sendiri. Awalnya saja. Aneh, ya?"

msgid "I'll dig it. Show me where."
msgstr "Aku yang akan menggalinya. Tunjukkan di mana."

msgid "I'll dig. I'm keeping the miller's money, though."
msgstr "Aku akan menggali. Tapi uang tukang giling tetap kusimpan."

msgid "I'll keep it on a low branch where I can see it. No, I won't use it to count time until our next meeting."
msgstr "Akan kutaruh di dahan rendah tempat aku bisa melihatnya. Tidak, aku tidak akan memakainya untuk menghitung waktu sampai kita bertemu lagi."

msgid "I'll list everyone in town you'd like to drop a branch on."
msgstr "Akan kusebutkan semua orang di kota yang ingin kamu jatuhi dahan."

msgid "I'll pay you, obviously. A reward, when we find it. It's a business arrangement, so you can stop smiling like that."
msgstr "Aku akan membayarmu, tentu. Hadiah, kalau kita menemukannya. Ini kesepakatan bisnis, jadi berhenti senyum-senyum begitu."

msgid "I'll pretend I didn't see that."
msgstr "Aku pura-pura tidak lihat."

msgid "I'm 18 or older"
msgstr "Usiaku 18 tahun ke atas"

msgid "I'm a bit pink right now. Ignore it."
msgstr "Aku agak merah muda sekarang. Abaikan saja."

msgid "I'm fine. Midsummer Tide's in nine days, and I've checked maybe a third of the cove."
msgstr "Aku baik-baik saja. Pasang Tengah Musim Panas tinggal sembilan hari, dan aku baru memeriksa mungkin sepertiga teluk."

msgid "I'm glad I can help. Really."
msgstr "Aku senang bisa membantu. Sungguh."

msgid "I'm going to make you sound very brave. And very wet."
msgstr "Akan kubuat kamu terdengar sangat berani. Dan sangat basah."

msgid "I'm not watching you. I'm photosynthesising."
msgstr "Aku tidak memperhatikanmu. Aku sedang berfotosintesis."

msgid "I'm so sorry. I'll get every one of them back."
msgstr "Maaf sekali. Aku akan mengembalikan semuanya, satu per satu."

msgid "I'm... hah... don't pull out. Stay."
msgstr "Aku... hah... jangan dicabut. Tetap di situ."

msgid "I've been doing this for a very long time, and that was not on the list of things I expected from a library."
msgstr "Aku sudah melakukan ini sangat lama, dan yang barusan tidak ada di daftar hal yang kuharapkan dari perpustakaan."

msgid "I've been summoned by kings. They were worse at this."
msgstr "Aku pernah dipanggil raja-raja. Mereka lebih payah dalam hal ini."

msgid "I've been summoned four hundred and some times. Never seen such gentleman."
msgstr "Aku sudah dipanggil empat ratus kali lebih. Belum pernah bertemu pria sesopan ini."

msgid "I've never seen a morning from this side of a summoning. It's very bright. I don't hate it."
msgstr "Aku belum pernah melihat pagi dari sisi ini sebuah pemanggilan. Terang sekali. Aku tidak membencinya."

msgid "I've thought about this. Not a lot. A normal amount. Every day since the pier."
msgstr "Aku sudah memikirkan ini. Tidak banyak. Jumlah yang wajar. Setiap hari sejak di dermaga."

msgid "I-is that all right? Tell me if it's strange. You can say it's strange."
msgstr "B-begini tidak apa-apa? Bilang kalau aneh. Kamu boleh bilang ini aneh."

msgid "I-it's not going on the shelf. It stays with me. In here. Is that all right?"
msgstr "I-ini tidak akan kutaruh di rak. Ini tetap bersamaku. Di sini. Tidak apa-apa?"

msgid "If I find one, I'm burning it."
msgstr "Kalau aku menemukannya, akan kubakar."

msgid "If I'd known you liked it, I'd have come by sooner."
msgstr "Kalau aku tahu kamu suka, aku pasti datang lebih awal."

msgid "If anyone asks, we're friends. Who swim. At night."
msgstr "Kalau ada yang tanya, kita cuma teman. Yang berenang. Malam-malam."

msgid "If someone dug him a new channel, further out, I could follow it. It would take a season."
msgstr "Kalau ada yang menggalikan saluran baru untuknya, lebih jauh, aku bisa mengikutinya. Butuh satu musim."

msgid "If you drop anything, I'll find it."
msgstr "Kalau kamu menjatuhkan sesuatu, aku yang akan menemukannya."

msgid "If you find it before I do, don't open it."
msgstr "Kalau kamu menemukannya duluan, jangan dibuka."

msgid "If you're going to draw these, you'll draw them properly. Nobody else is coming through a circle this pathetic."
msgstr "Kalau kamu mau menggambar ini, gambar dengan benar. Tidak ada orang lain yang akan datang lewat lingkaran semenyedihkan ini."

msgid "In Full Bloom"
msgstr "Mekar Sempurna"

msgid "In her chapters everything floats: gems rise, and new ones come up from the bottom."
msgstr "Di bab-babnya semuanya mengapung: permata naik, dan yang baru datang dari bawah."

msgid "In my defence, the label said newts."
msgstr "Sebagai pembelaan, labelnya bilang kadal air."

msgid "In my experience, the people who don't ask want something worse. So. What is it?"
msgstr "Menurut pengalamanku, orang yang tidak meminta justru menginginkan sesuatu yang lebih buruk. Jadi. Apa itu?"

msgid "In the back, under a dust sheet, you find a black cover with nothing in it. The pages have been cut out with a knife."
msgstr "Di bagian belakang, di bawah kain penutup debu, kalian menemukan sampul hitam tanpa isi. Halaman-halamannya sudah dipotong dengan pisau."

msgid "Instant"
msgstr "Instan"

msgid "Irresistible"
msgstr "Tak Tertahankan"

msgid "It has sexual content, including intimate scenes, and suggestive art. All characters are adults.\n\nPlease only continue if you're 18 or older, or the age of majority where you live."
msgstr "Game ini berisi konten seksual, termasuk adegan intim, dan gambar sugestif. Semua karakter sudah dewasa.\n\nLanjutkan hanya jika kamu berusia 18 tahun ke atas, atau sudah dewasa menurut hukum di tempatmu."

msgid "It isn't so bad, but some animals are... Barely tolerable company."
msgstr "Tidak terlalu buruk, tapi beberapa hewan... teman yang nyaris tak tertahankan."

msgid "It pulls you over with her. You hold her down on you and spill deep inside, pulse after pulse."
msgstr "Itu menarikmu ikut bersamanya. Kamu menahannya di atasmu dan menyembur jauh di dalam, denyut demi denyut."

msgid "It rains all night. None of it reaches you."
msgstr "Hujan turun sepanjang malam. Tidak setetes pun mengenaimu."

msgid "It starts to rain"
msgstr "Mulai hujan"

msgid "It was a joke. He laughed at it every single morning for thirty-one years."
msgstr "Itu lelucon. Dia menertawakannya setiap pagi selama tiga puluh satu tahun."

msgid "It was a very good storm."
msgstr "Badai yang sangat bagus."

msgid "It was an excellent storm."
msgstr "Badai yang luar biasa."

msgid "It was here. Someone moved it, and not long ago."
msgstr "Buku itu tadinya di sini. Ada yang memindahkannya, belum lama."

msgid "It's April."
msgstr "Ini bulan April."

msgid "It's all here. All of it. I counted three times."
msgstr "Semuanya ada. Semuanya. Aku sudah menghitung tiga kali."

msgid "It's down there! I've checked everywhere else, it has to be down there!"
msgstr "Sisirnya ada di bawah sana! Aku sudah mencari di mana-mana, pasti di bawah sana!"

msgid "It's fine. It's just roots. They have to let go of the old wall even if it hurts."
msgstr "Tidak apa-apa. Itu cuma akar. Mereka harus melepaskan dinding lama meskipun sakit."

msgid "It's loud out here. You're the good kind of loud."
msgstr "Di luar sini berisik. Kamu berisik yang menyenangkan."

msgid "It's not even scratched."
msgstr "Bahkan tidak tergores."

msgid "It's only when you're heaving her onto the boards that you notice the tail. It's long, it's teal, and it's slapping the pier hard enough to soak everyone."
msgstr "Baru saat kamu mengangkatnya ke papan dermaga kamu melihat ekornya. Panjang, hijau toska, dan menghantam dermaga begitu keras sampai semua orang kecipratan."

msgid "It's somewhere in this building. I can feel it, like a draught. You're going to help me find it before anyone else does."
msgstr "Buku itu ada di suatu tempat di gedung ini. Aku bisa merasakannya, seperti angin yang menyusup. Kamu akan membantuku menemukannya sebelum orang lain."

msgid "It's the chalk. Cheap chalk gets in your throat."
msgstr "Kapurnya. Kapur murahan bikin tenggorokan gatal."

msgid "It's the first thing in a new collection. Things that are yours."
msgstr "Ini barang pertama di koleksi baru. Barang-barang milikmu."

