msgid "Last night was the best thing that's happened to me in thirty-one years. Possibly... ever."
msgstr "Semalam adalah hal terbaik yang terjadi padaku dalam tiga puluh satu tahun. Mungkin... sepanjang hidup."

msgid "Later. The candle is down to a stub. She's lying across you on the reading room rug with one wing folded over you both like a blanket."
msgstr "Kemudian. Lilinnya tinggal puntung. Dia berbaring di atasmu di karpet ruang baca, satu sayap terlipat menyelimuti kalian berdua."

