msgid "Morning comes in through the reading room windows. Somebody has folded your jacket into a very neat square."
msgstr "Pagi masuk lewat jendela ruang baca. Seseorang sudah melipat jaketmu jadi persegi yang sangat rapi."

msgid "Morning in the grove. There's blossom on the east side of the tree that wasn't there last night. Hazels flower in February. It's May."
msgstr "Pagi di hutan kecil. Ada bunga di sisi timur pohon yang semalam belum ada. Pohon hazel berbunga di bulan Februari. Ini bulan Mei."

msgid "Morning light through the bedroom curtains, and someone translucent and lilac curled over the covers."
msgstr "Cahaya pagi menembus tirai kamar, dan seseorang yang bening dan ungu muda meringkuk di atas selimut."

msgid "Morning. Your clothes are on the rail. I wrung them out myself, so you can thank me."
msgstr "Pagi. Bajumu di pagar. Aku sendiri yang memerasnya, jadi kamu boleh berterima kasih."

msgid "Moss grows under some cells. A match, blast or Hammer on the cell clears it, and some moss hides one of her lost things."
msgstr "Lumut tumbuh di bawah beberapa petak. Kecocokan, ledakan, atau Palu di petak itu membersihkannya, dan sebagian lumut menyembunyikan salah satu barangnya yang hilang."

msgid "Most people come down here for the game. You keep coming back for me, don't you?"
msgstr "Kebanyakan orang datang ke sini untuk permainan itu. Kamu terus kembali karena aku, kan?"

msgid "Most summonings end the moment someone gets what they asked for. You never asked for anything. So... I stayed."
msgstr "Kebanyakan pemanggilan berakhir begitu seseorang mendapat apa yang dia minta. Kamu tidak pernah meminta apa pun. Jadi... aku tetap di sini."

msgid "Mostly couples who thought they'd found somewhere private. So I know a lot about... you know."
msgstr "Kebanyakan pasangan yang mengira sudah menemukan tempat sepi. Jadi aku tahu banyak soal... kamu tahulah."

msgid "Move"
msgstr "Gerak"

msgid "Moves left this chapter"
msgstr "Sisa langkah di bab ini"

msgid "Mum wants to feed you. Consider yourself warned."
msgstr "Mama mau memberimu makan. Anggap ini peringatan."

msgid "Music"
msgstr "Musik"

msgid "Neither of you notices what was coming."
msgstr "Kalian berdua tidak menyadari apa yang akan datang."

