msgid "Petals are drifting down around you both. The hazel has flowered. It's the wrong season for it."
msgstr "Kelopak bunga melayang turun di sekitar kalian berdua. Pohon hazel itu berbunga. Ini bukan musimnya."

msgid "Petals. Good. Those I understand."
msgstr "Kelopak. Bagus. Itu aku mengerti."

