msgstr "Ambil"

msgid "Pickled newts don't usually have a date pencilled on the wax: the second of January. You open it anyway."
msgstr "Kadal air acar biasanya tidak punya tanggal yang ditulis pensil di atas lilin: dua Januari. Kamu tetap membukanya."

msgid "Pictures"
msgstr "Gambar"

msgid "Pictures appear here as you meet the girls and reach their endings."
msgstr "Gambar muncul di sini seiring kamu bertemu para gadis dan mencapai akhir cerita mereka."

