msgid "Something cool and slightly heavy is draped over you like a blanket. It turns out to be her."
msgstr "Sesuatu yang sejuk dan agak berat terhampar di atasmu seperti selimut. Ternyata dia."

msgid "Something pours over the rim, slow and shining, pale lilac with flashes of green and pink in it. You jump back so fast you kick half the hollow into the stream. It gathers itself on a root into the shape of a woman, and she does not look happy."
msgstr "Sesuatu meluap dari bibir stoples, pelan dan berkilau, ungu muda dengan kilasan hijau dan merah muda. Kamu melompat mundur begitu cepat sampai separuh lekukan itu tertendang ke sungai. Benda itu mengumpul di atas akar menjadi sosok seorang wanita, dan dia tidak kelihatan senang."

msgid "Sorry. I don't usually get to tell anyone."
msgstr "Maaf. Biasanya aku tidak punya siapa-siapa untuk diajak cerita."

msgid "Sorry. I spread out in my sleep. I didn't know that. I've never slept anywhere big enough to find out."
msgstr "Maaf. Aku melebar waktu tidur. Aku tidak tahu itu. Aku belum pernah tidur di tempat yang cukup luas untuk mengetahuinya."

msgid "Sorry. I'm watching. Is that all right?"
msgstr "Maaf. Aku menonton. Tidak apa-apa?"

msgid "Sound Effects"
msgstr "Efek Suara"

msgid "Spark route"
msgstr "Rute Percikan"

msgid "Special gems"
msgstr "Permata spesial"

msgid "Special gems made"
msgstr "Permata spesial dibuat"

msgid "Splinters"
msgstr "Serpihan"

msgid "Starburst Starter"
msgstr "Starter Ledakan Bintang"

msgid "Starburst Starter active!"
msgstr "Starter Ledakan Bintang aktif!"

msgid "Stars come from clearing chapters: 15 for a girl's first and 5 more for each one after it."
msgstr "Bintang didapat dari menyelesaikan bab: 15 untuk bab pertama seorang gadis dan 5 lebih banyak untuk setiap bab sesudahnya."

msgid "Stars — earned by clearing chapters, spent in the Item Shop and on gifts."
msgstr "Bintang — didapat dengan menyelesaikan bab, dipakai di Toko Item dan untuk hadiah."

msgid "Starstruck"
msgstr "Terpesona Bintang"

msgid "Start at the alder. I'll enjoy the view."
msgstr "Mulai dari pohon alder. Aku akan menikmati pemandangan."

msgid "Start her story over from the beginning"
msgstr "Mulai ceritanya lagi dari awal"

msgid "Start with the baker. He leans on me when he smokes."
msgstr "Mulai dari tukang roti. Dia bersandar padaku kalau merokok."

msgid "Starter Pack"
msgstr "Paket Awal"

msgid "Stats"
msgstr "Statistik"

msgid "Stay till the candle goes. Then stay anyway."
msgstr "Tinggal sampai lilinnya habis. Lalu tetap tinggal."

msgid "Stay tonight. I'll keep the rain off."
msgstr "Menginaplah malam ini. Aku akan menahan hujan."

msgid "Stay where you are. Don't break the circle. If that candle goes out, I go home, and I'm not done with you."
msgstr "Diam di situ. Jangan rusak lingkarannya. Kalau lilin itu padam, aku pulang, dan urusanku denganmu belum selesai."

msgid "Still nothing?"
msgstr "Masih tidak ada?"

msgid "Stop here. This scene plays again next time you visit her."
msgstr "Berhenti di sini. Adegan ini diputar lagi saat kamu mengunjunginya nanti."

msgid "Stop pretending you're looking for the book. You've walked past this table eleven times tonight, and the book isn't on it. I am."
msgstr "Berhenti pura-pura mencari buku. Kamu sudah lewat di depan meja ini sebelas kali malam ini, dan bukunya tidak ada di sini. Aku yang ada."

msgid "Stop. I'll go cloudy."
msgstr "Berhenti. Nanti aku jadi keruh."

msgid "Store"
msgstr "Toko"

msgid "Story"
msgstr "Cerita"

msgid "Story Pass"
msgstr "Story Pass"

msgid "Story Pass: 8 hearts and free skips · %s"
msgstr "Story Pass: 8 hati dan lewati bebas · %s"

msgid "Story difficulty: carry on with the story without playing this chapter (no stars for it)."
msgstr "Tingkat Cerita: lanjutkan cerita tanpa memainkan bab ini (tanpa bintang)."

msgid "Story: twice the moves, and you can skip any chapter. Hard: every few moves something happens on your date (a wave over the pier, the candles gutter), shown in advance. Takes effect from the next chapter."
msgstr "Cerita: dua kali lipat langkah, dan kamu bisa melewati bab mana saja. Sulit: setiap beberapa langkah ada kejadian saat kencanmu (ombak menerjang dermaga, lilin berkedip), diberi tahu lebih dulu. Berlaku mulai bab berikutnya."

msgid "Succubus, summoned by mistake"
msgstr "Sukubus, terpanggil karena salah"

msgid "Summer"
msgstr "Musim Panas"

msgid "Summer!"
msgstr "Musim Panas!"

msgid "Sure. After I've shelved these returns."
msgstr "Oke. Setelah aku menata buku-buku kembalian ini."

msgid "Swap"
msgstr "Tukar"

msgid "Swap and match"
msgstr "Tukar dan cocokkan"

msgid "Swap two gems next to each other to line up three or more of the same kind. Matched gems pop and score points; new ones fall in from the top."
msgstr "Tukar dua permata yang bersebelahan untuk menjajarkan tiga atau lebih yang sejenis. Permata yang cocok akan pecah dan memberi poin; permata baru jatuh dari atas."

msgid "Swap two special gems together."
msgstr "Tukar dua permata spesial sekaligus."

msgid "Swim with me later. Don't embarrass me again."
msgstr "Berenanglah denganku nanti. Jangan bikin aku malu lagi."

msgid "THINGS FOUND"
msgstr "BARANG DITEMUKAN"

msgid "TIP"
msgstr "TIPS"

msgid "Take your time. I've got about three hundred years."
msgstr "Santai saja. Aku masih punya kira-kira tiga ratus tahun."

msgid "Talk to me. About anything. Your voice helps me get through it."
msgstr "Bicaralah padaku. Soal apa saja. Suaramu membantuku melewatinya."

msgid "Tap a gem!"
msgstr "Ketuk sebuah permata!"

msgid "Tell her the jeweller ran off with a sea captain."
msgstr "Bilang saja tukang perhiasannya kabur dengan seorang kapten kapal."

msgid "Tell her the truth. She'll understand."
msgstr "Katakan yang sebenarnya. Dia pasti mengerti."

msgid "Tell me about the grove when it was a forest."
msgstr "Ceritakan soal hutan kecil ini waktu masih hutan lebat."

msgid "Tell me about the others while we look."
msgstr "Ceritakan soal yang lain sambil kita mencari."

msgid "Tell me if I get this wrong. I've read about it in exactly one book, and a woodcutter dropped it here before the mill was built."
msgstr "Bilang kalau aku salah. Aku membaca soal ini di tepat satu buku, dan seorang penebang kayu menjatuhkannya di sini sebelum kincir dibangun."

msgid "Tempting. You'd have to do my shelving."
msgstr "Menggoda. Kamu harus menata buku-bukuku."

msgid "Test purchase"
msgstr "Pembelian uji coba"

msgid "Testing Mode"
msgstr "Mode Uji"

msgid "Text Speed"
msgstr "Kecepatan Teks"

msgid "Text size"
msgstr "Ukuran teks"

msgid "Th-thank you. Sorry. No. Not sorry. Thank you."
msgstr "T-terima kasih. Maaf. Tidak. Bukan maaf. Terima kasih."

msgid "Th-thank you. Sorry. Thank you."
msgstr "T-terima kasih. Maaf. Terima kasih."

msgid "Th-that was good. That was really good."
msgstr "T-tadi itu bagus. Bagus sekali."

msgid "Thanks for playing the demo!"
msgstr "Terima kasih sudah memainkan demo ini!"

msgid "That catches the light. Do another."
msgstr "Itu menangkap cahaya. Satu lagi."

msgid "That night she climbs down from her branch and walks out across the grass, further than you've ever seen her go."
msgstr "Malam itu dia turun dari dahannya dan berjalan menyeberangi rumput, lebih jauh dari yang pernah kamu lihat."

msgid "That one would actually hold a demon."
msgstr "Yang itu benar-benar bisa menahan iblis."

msgid "That one's fine. That one's fine. Not that one. I mean it. Don't."
msgstr "Yang itu boleh. Yang itu boleh. Bukan yang itu. Aku serius. Jangan."

msgid "That sounds strange out loud. Don't answer that."
msgstr "Kalau diucapkan keras-keras kedengarannya aneh. Tidak usah dijawab."

msgid "That was the storm. Don't make it a thing."
msgstr "Itu gara-gara badai. Jangan dibesar-besarkan."

msgid "That was very nice. Thank you."
msgstr "Itu bagus sekali. Terima kasih."

msgid "That was. Okay. I don't have a word. I always have a word."
msgstr "Tadi itu. Oke. Aku kehabisan kata. Aku tidak pernah kehabisan kata."

msgid "That's a dry-land gem. Put it back."
msgstr "Itu permata darat. Taruh lagi."

msgid "That's a good trench, for a grave."
msgstr "Parit yang bagus. Untuk kuburan."

msgid "That's actually good. She'd believe that."
msgstr "Itu sebenarnya bagus. Dia pasti percaya."

msgid "That's all of them. I'm free. No more circles. Nobody can drag me anywhere ever again."
msgstr "Itu yang terakhir. Aku bebas. Tidak ada lingkaran lagi. Tidak ada yang bisa menyeretku ke mana pun lagi."

msgid "That's autumn."
msgstr "Itu musim gugur."

msgid "That's lovely. Keep going."
msgstr "Indah. Teruskan."

msgid "That's nine more hours you can't get rid of me. You did that on purpose."
msgstr "Itu sembilan jam lagi kamu tidak bisa menyingkirkanku. Kamu sengaja."

msgid "That's off the comb's box. So it went right in there."
msgstr "Ini dari kotak sisirnya. Jadi sisir itu jatuh tepat di sini."

msgid "That's real. The sea made that. People tumble old bottles in a barrel and sell it as sea glass."
msgstr "Ini asli. Laut yang membuatnya. Ada orang yang menggulingkan botol bekas di tong lalu menjualnya sebagai kaca laut."

msgid "That's the first one I've felt."
msgstr "Itu yang pertama yang kurasakan."

msgid "That's the good stuff. Again."
msgstr "Nah, itu yang bagus. Lagi."

msgid "That's why Ambrose put me in the jar. Nobody looks inside a jar of pickled newts. We were the same age when he did it, near enough. He got old."
msgstr "Karena itulah Ambrose menaruhku di stoples. Tidak ada yang melihat ke dalam stoples kadal air acar. Kami kurang lebih seumur waktu dia melakukannya. Dia menua."

msgid "That's you. You did that. A month of you leaning on me with your sleeves rolled up."
msgstr "Itu karena kamu. Kamu yang membuatnya begitu. Sebulan kamu bersandar padaku dengan lengan baju tergulung."

msgid "That's your fault. I'd like that on record."
msgstr "Itu salahmu. Tolong dicatat."

msgid "The Time Scroll (three more moves), the Hammer (smash any one gem) and the Shuffle Wand (a new board) sit under the board. Buy them, and potions that help a whole chapter, in the Item Shop with the stars you earn."
msgstr "Gulungan Waktu (tiga langkah tambahan), Palu (hancurkan satu permata apa saja) dan Tongkat Pengocok (papan baru) ada di bawah papan. Beli semuanya, juga ramuan yang membantu sepanjang bab, di Toko Item dengan bintang yang kamu dapat."

msgid "The animals are watching. I told them to go away. Nobody in this grove listens to me."
msgstr "Hewan-hewan menonton. Sudah kusuruh pergi. Tidak ada yang mendengarkanku di hutan kecil ini."

msgid "The boathouse slipway at sunrise, two sets of clothes drying on the rail."
msgstr "Landasan gudang perahu saat matahari terbit, dua setel pakaian dijemur di pagar."

msgid "The boathouse smells of tar and salt. There's a heap of old sails in the corner, and she pulls you down onto them by your wet shirt."
msgstr "Gudang perahu berbau ter dan garam. Ada tumpukan layar tua di sudut, dan dia menarikmu ke atasnya lewat kemejamu yang basah."

msgid "The book is in this building. Keep going."
msgstr "Bukunya ada di gedung ini. Terus."

msgid "The candle burns down to nothing, and neither of you notices when it goes out."
msgstr "Lilin itu terbakar habis, dan tak satu pun dari kalian menyadari kapan ia padam."

msgid "The candle in your chalk circle, the fourth one this week, is nearly gone. She watches it gutter and doesn't go anywhere."
msgstr "Lilin di lingkaran kapurmu, yang keempat minggu ini, hampir habis. Dia melihatnya berkedip dan tidak pergi ke mana-mana."

msgid "The candles gutter"
msgstr "Lilin-lilin berkedip"

msgid "The card catalogue has a gap where the book should be. Someone has left a slip in the drawer instead: OUT FOR REBINDING, and a name."
msgstr "Katalog kartu punya celah di tempat buku itu seharusnya. Ada yang meninggalkan secarik kertas di laci: SEDANG DIJILID ULANG, dan sebuah nama."

msgid "The comb is in a tin of odds and ends on the Pellow brothers' boat: fishing weights, a doll's head, and nine pearls on a silver spine. It costs you two weeks' pay and a lot of explaining."
msgstr "Sisir itu ada di kaleng berisi barang rongsokan di perahu Pellow bersaudara: pemberat pancing, kepala boneka, dan sembilan mutiara di punggung perak. Harganya dua minggu upahmu dan banyak penjelasan."

msgid "The comb piece can't be hammered. Bring it up to the surface."
msgstr "Kepingan sisir tidak bisa dipalu. Angkat ke permukaan."

msgid "The ferns tell me you were talking to the miller's daughter. I'm not jealous. But I might drop a branch near her, that's all."
msgstr "Kata para pakis kamu mengobrol dengan putri tukang giling. Aku tidak cemburu. Tapi mungkin aku menjatuhkan dahan di dekatnya, itu saja."

msgid "The flame leans sideways. Then it goes green. Smoke fills the circle, smelling of struck matches and expensive perfume, and someone steps out of it, coughing."
msgstr "Apinya condong ke samping. Lalu jadi hijau. Asap memenuhi lingkaran, berbau korek api yang baru digores dan parfum mahal, dan seseorang melangkah keluar darinya sambil batuk."

msgid "The full game has four stories: Hazel's, and three more women of Millbrook to meet in the worst way possible. Each has four chapters, her night scene and her ending."
msgstr "Game lengkapnya punya empat cerita: cerita Hazel, dan tiga wanita Millbrook lain yang kamu temui dengan cara terburuk. Masing-masing punya empat bab, adegan malamnya, dan akhir ceritanya."

msgid "The game's text. Voices stay in English."
msgstr "Teks game. Suara tetap dalam bahasa Inggris."

msgid "The girls are voiced by amateur voice actresses, recorded at home. We love how they turned out, but they aren't studio recordings, and not every line is voiced yet.\n\nIf you'd rather read in your own head, turn the voices off. You can change this any time in Settings."
msgstr "Para gadis disuarakan oleh pengisi suara amatir, direkam di rumah. Kami suka hasilnya, tapi ini bukan rekaman studio, dan belum semua baris diisi suara.\n\nKalau kamu lebih suka membaca dalam hati, matikan suaranya. Kamu bisa mengubahnya kapan saja di Pengaturan."

msgid "The glass eye turns up in the window of the taxidermist's on Lantern Street, in a stuffed owl. The taxidermist won't sell it. He says the owl needs it."
msgstr "Mata kaca itu muncul di etalase toko pengawet hewan di Jalan Lentera, di dalam seekor burung hantu yang diawetkan. Si pengawet tidak mau menjualnya. Katanya burung hantunya butuh."

msgid "The green at the tips of her hair goes a shade darker. She notices, and decides not to mention it."
msgstr "Hijau di ujung rambutnya menggelap satu tingkat. Dia menyadarinya, dan memutuskan tidak membahasnya."

msgid "The head rests against her entrance. She's pulsing there, slow, like something rising in spring."
msgstr "Kepalanya bertumpu di pintu masuknya. Dia berdenyut di sana, pelan, seperti sesuatu yang naik di musim semi."

msgid "The jar stays empty all night."
msgstr "Stoples itu kosong sepanjang malam."

msgid "The jar... Should I keep it?"
msgstr "Stoplesnya... Perlu kusimpan?"

msgid "The keys went to a locksmith, he says. And the glass eye went to someone who needed a glass eye, I suppose."
msgstr "Kuncinya dibawa ke tukang kunci, katanya. Dan mata kacanya ke seseorang yang butuh mata kaca, kurasa."

msgid "The ledger leads you straight back to your own library. The last pages were sold to it in March as loose leaves, assorted, and filed in the rare books vault under Miscellaneous, Infernal."
msgstr "Buku besar itu membawa kalian kembali ke perpustakaanmu sendiri. Halaman-halaman terakhir dijual ke sana pada bulan Maret sebagai lembaran lepas, campuran, dan disimpan di ruang buku langka dengan label Lain-lain, Neraka."

msgid "The locksmith on Cinder Row has her keys in a bucket and wants a shilling for the lot. While you haggle, she stays very still in her jar under the counter."
msgstr "Tukang kunci di Jalan Bara menyimpan kunci-kuncinya di ember dan minta satu shilling untuk semuanya. Selama kamu menawar, dia diam sekali di stoplesnya di bawah meja."

msgid "The mermaid looks at you properly for the first time. You're dripping. You've lost a shoe."
msgstr "Si putri duyung menatapmu dengan sungguh-sungguh untuk pertama kalinya. Kamu basah kuyup. Sepatumu hilang sebelah."

msgid "The miller sent you? He sends someone every spring."
msgstr "Tukang giling yang mengirimmu? Dia mengirim seseorang setiap musim semi."

msgid "The miller walks past"
msgstr "Tukang giling lewat"

msgid "The millrace runs and the old hazel keeps her roots. You plant another hazel beside the new channel, and it grows faster than it has any right to, leaning towards the old tree as if it's listening. You sleep in the grove more nights than not, and the old hazel blossoms in the wrong season, every season, which the miller now tells people is good luck."
msgstr "Saluran kincir mengalir dan pohon hazel tua tetap punya akarnya. Kamu menanam pohon hazel lain di samping saluran baru, dan pohon itu tumbuh lebih cepat dari seharusnya, condong ke arah pohon tua seolah mendengarkan. Kamu lebih sering tidur di hutan kecil itu daripada tidak, dan pohon hazel tua berbunga di musim yang salah, di setiap musim, yang kini disebut tukang giling sebagai pembawa keberuntungan."

msgid "The moss on the east side is softer than it looks."
msgstr "Lumut di sisi timur lebih lembut dari kelihatannya."

msgid "The moss on the east side is softer than it looks. Above you her branches have spread and knitted together, and the first rain ticks against the leaves without coming through."
msgstr "Lumut di sisi timur lebih lembut dari kelihatannya. Di atasmu dahan-dahannya merentang dan saling menjalin, dan hujan pertama mengetuk dedaunan tanpa menembus."

msgid "The name on the slip belongs to a bookbinder who died in the spring. His shop is still full of loose pages."
msgstr "Nama di kertas itu milik penjilid buku yang meninggal musim semi lalu. Tokonya masih penuh halaman lepas."

msgid "The old hazel at dawn, in full blossom, in May."
msgstr "Pohon hazel tua saat fajar, mekar penuh, di bulan Mei."

msgid "The old hazel stands where the grove meets the millrace. It's so big that the mill's back wall has started to bend round its roots."
msgstr "Pohon hazel tua itu berdiri di tempat hutan kecil bertemu saluran kincir. Pohonnya begitu besar sampai dinding belakang kincir mulai melengkung mengitari akarnya."

msgid "The pier's quiet apart from the Thursday tile game at the far end, where the three old fishermen are arguing about the score again."
msgstr "Dermaga sepi, kecuali permainan hari Kamis di ujung sana, tempat tiga nelayan tua itu kembali meributkan skor."

msgid "The purchase couldn't start (%s)."
msgstr "Pembelian tidak bisa dimulai (%s)."

msgid "The purchase didn't go through (%s)."
msgstr "Pembelian tidak berhasil (%s)."

msgid "The reading room at dawn: a burnt-out candle in a smudged chalk circle, your jacket folded into a neat square on the returns cart."
msgstr "Ruang baca saat fajar: lilin yang habis terbakar di lingkaran kapur yang luntur, jaketmu terlipat rapi di troli buku kembalian."

msgid "The reading room with the door shut. The only light is the candle in your chalk circle, and she's sitting on the reading table again."
msgstr "Ruang baca dengan pintu tertutup. Satu-satunya cahaya dari lilin di lingkaran kapurmu, dan dia duduk di meja baca lagi."

msgid "The reward is you come to every Tide from now on. Non-negotiable. Don't smile, it's a punishment."
msgstr "Hadiahnya adalah kamu datang ke setiap Pasang mulai sekarang. Tidak bisa ditawar. Jangan senyum, ini hukuman."

msgid "The store isn't available in this build."
msgstr "Toko tidak tersedia di versi ini."

msgid "The stream comes out under the Mill Bridge, where Coombs the rag-and-bone man fishes for anything that floats. You get there ahead of her and sell him a handful of buttons off the bank for two coppers before you realise whose they are. He's netted the rest too. Buying the lot back costs six coppers, which he finds very funny."
msgstr "Sungai itu keluar di bawah Jembatan Kincir, tempat Coombs si pemulung memancing apa saja yang mengapung. Kamu tiba duluan dan menjual segenggam kancing dari tepian kepadanya seharga dua keping tembaga sebelum sadar milik siapa itu. Sisanya juga sudah dia jaring. Membeli kembali semuanya menghabiskan enam keping tembaga, dan dia menganggap itu sangat lucu."

msgid "The stream goes to town. We're going. You're carrying me! Please?"
msgstr "Sungainya mengalir ke kota. Kita ke sana. Kamu yang bawa aku! Ya?"

msgid "The taxidermist is so startled he gives her the eye, the owl, and a discount on a second owl."
msgstr "Si pengawet begitu kaget sampai memberinya mata itu, burung hantunya, dan potongan harga untuk burung hantu kedua."

msgid "The tide turns"
msgstr "Air pasang berbalik"

msgid "The top row is used during a chapter; the bottom row kicks in on its own when your next chapter starts."
msgstr "Baris atas dipakai saat bab berlangsung; baris bawah aktif sendiri saat bab berikutnya dimulai."

msgid "The trench reaches the river on the night of a storm. Water floods into the new channel, and the whole tree shudders."
msgstr "Parit itu mencapai sungai pada malam badai. Air membanjiri saluran baru, dan seluruh pohon bergetar."

msgid "The two rows nearest the surface clear, and everything rises two rows."
msgstr "Dua baris paling dekat ke permukaan bersih, dan semuanya naik dua baris."

msgid "The water in the cove is warm and black and full of moonlight. She surfaces right in front of you, close enough that her hair brushes your face."
msgstr "Air teluk hangat, hitam, dan penuh cahaya bulan. Dia muncul tepat di depanmu, begitu dekat sampai rambutnya menyapu wajahmu."

msgid "The water's warm tonight."
msgstr "Airnya hangat malam ini."

msgid "The woods north of Millbrook, late autumn. You're out gathering firewood and anything worth selling, and you've followed the stream further in than you meant to."
msgstr "Hutan di utara Millbrook, akhir musim gugur. Kamu sedang mengumpulkan kayu bakar dan apa saja yang bisa dijual, dan kamu mengikuti sungai kecil lebih jauh dari niatmu."

msgid "Their net. It went right through where I dropped it."
msgstr "Jaring mereka. Lewat tepat di tempat sisir itu jatuh."

msgid "Then I'll ask. Close the reading room door. Leave the candle."
msgstr "Kalau begitu aku yang minta. Tutup pintu ruang baca. Biarkan lilinnya."

msgid "Then she notices the loose page on your desk, the one you copied from, and goes very still."
msgstr "Lalu dia melihat halaman lepas di mejamu, yang kamu salin, dan langsung terdiam."

msgid "Then she rises. Her walls cling to you the whole way up, until only the head is left in her."
msgstr "Lalu dia naik. Dindingnya menempel padamu sepanjang jalan, sampai hanya kepalanya yang tersisa di dalam."

msgid "Then the miller. Then the miller again."
msgstr "Lalu tukang giling. Lalu tukang giling lagi."

msgid "Then we'd better find them before anyone else does."
msgstr "Kalau begitu sebaiknya kita temukan sebelum orang lain."

msgid "Then we'll make sure nobody's boiling anybody."
msgstr "Kalau begitu kita pastikan tidak ada yang merebus siapa pun."

msgid "Then you remember the Pellow brothers dragging their nets through the cove last week. The whole pier complained about it."
msgstr "Lalu kamu teringat Pellow bersaudara yang menyeret jaring mereka di teluk minggu lalu. Seluruh dermaga mengeluh soal itu."

msgid "There are forty-one of those. I counted when I put it on. Take your time."
msgstr "Ada empat puluh satu. Aku menghitungnya waktu memakainya. Santai saja."

msgid "There were wolves. And a family of woodcutters who sang while they worked. I liked them, even though they were woodcutters."
msgstr "Dulu ada serigala. Dan sebuah keluarga penebang kayu yang bernyanyi sambil bekerja. Aku suka mereka, meskipun mereka penebang kayu."

msgid "There's a woman sitting on the lowest branch, where you're sure nobody was a second ago. Her hair goes from gold to green, and below the knee her legs turn into bark."
msgstr "Ada seorang wanita duduk di dahan terendah, padahal kamu yakin sedetik lalu tidak ada siapa-siapa. Rambutnya berubah dari emas ke hijau, dan di bawah lutut kakinya menjadi kulit kayu."

msgid "There. Now look me in the eye and tell me you'd rather be shelving."
msgstr "Nah. Sekarang tatap mataku dan bilang kamu lebih suka menata buku."

msgid "There. Now we're even. Low tide's at six."
msgstr "Nah. Sekarang kita impas. Air surut jam enam."

msgid "There. Now you can't go anywhere. It's a mermaid thing. It's very old. I just made it up."
msgstr "Nah. Sekarang kamu tidak bisa ke mana-mana. Ini tradisi putri duyung. Sangat kuno. Baru kukarang."

msgid "There... mmh... there, there, there..."
msgstr "Di situ... mmh... di situ, di situ, di situ..."

msgid "These unlock on Steam too."
msgstr "Ini juga terbuka di Steam."

msgid "They start clearing on quarter day. After that I need somewhere else to be quiet."
msgstr "Mereka mulai menebang pada hari kuartal. Setelah itu aku butuh tempat lain yang tenang."

msgid "They want an address for my library card. I don't have one. What do I put?"
msgstr "Mereka minta alamat untuk kartu perpustakaanku. Aku tidak punya. Aku tulis apa?"

msgid "They're a pair. I'm not splitting up a pair."
msgstr "Mereka sepasang. Aku tidak mau memisahkan pasangan."

msgid "They're not strangers. I heard every one of them go by. From the jar."
msgstr "Mereka bukan orang asing. Aku mendengar setiap orang lewat. Dari dalam stoples."

msgid "Things found"
msgstr "Barang ditemukan"

msgid "This erases every girl's story progress, your stars, items, gifts and the whole Gallery. Your settings and achievements are kept. This can't be undone."
msgstr "Ini menghapus progres cerita setiap gadis, bintang, item, hadiah, dan seluruh Galeri. Pengaturan dan pencapaianmu tetap disimpan. Ini tidak bisa dibatalkan."

msgid "This is a test build: no money changes hands. Buy %s for %s?"
msgstr "Ini versi uji coba: tidak ada uang yang berpindah. Beli %s seharga %s?"

msgid "This line here. That's where you'd put my name. If you ever wanted to call me. You won't need to. I'll be with you."
msgstr "Garis di sini. Di situ kamu menaruh namaku. Kalau suatu hari kamu ingin memanggilku. Kamu tidak akan perlu. Aku akan bersamamu."

msgid "This one's my favourite. Brass, four holes, off a very handsome coat. You have a very handsome... coat too."
msgstr "Yang ini favoritku. Kuningan, empat lubang, dari mantel yang sangat tampan. Kamu juga punya... mantel yang sangat tampan."

msgid "This page is from my binding. The book that ties me to every circle anyone draws, however badly. Find all of it, burn it, and I'm free."
msgstr "Halaman ini dari ikatanku. Buku yang mengikatku ke setiap lingkaran yang digambar siapa pun, seburuk apa pun. Temukan seluruhnya, bakar, dan aku bebas."

msgid "Those are mine. I-I've been collecting them for years."
msgstr "Itu milikku. A-aku sudah mengumpulkannya bertahun-tahun."

msgid "Time Scroll"
msgstr "Gulungan Waktu"

msgid "To find the book, break every seal on the board. The counter under the board shows how many are done."
msgstr "Untuk menemukan buku itu, pecahkan semua segel di papan. Penghitung di bawah papan menunjukkan berapa yang sudah."

msgid "Today's challenge"
msgstr "Tantangan hari ini"

msgid "Toggle"
msgstr "Ubah"

msgid "Treasure Diver"
msgstr "Penyelam Harta"

msgid "Treasury of Stars"
msgstr "Harta Bintang"

msgid "Try: %s"
msgstr "Coba: %s"

msgid "Turn voices off"
msgstr "Matikan suara"

msgid "Twenty minutes?"
msgstr "Dua puluh menit?"

msgid "Two hundred springs I've watched people walk past this tree. Not one of them ever lay down under it."
msgstr "Dua ratus musim semi aku melihat orang lewat di depan pohon ini. Tak seorang pun pernah berbaring di bawahnya."

msgid "Two hundred years, and nobody told me a spirit could feel like that. I'd like it noted that I'm saying this very calmly."
msgstr "Dua ratus tahun, dan tidak ada yang memberitahuku roh bisa merasakan seperti itu. Tolong dicatat aku mengatakannya dengan sangat tenang."

msgid "Ugh. That's drier than a sponge."
msgstr "Ih. Lebih kering dari spons."

msgid "Unlimited Hearts"
msgstr "Hati Tanpa Batas"

msgid "Unlimited for 24 hours · %s"
msgstr "Tanpa batas selama 24 jam · %s"

msgid "Unlimited hearts: %s left"
msgstr "Hati tanpa batas: sisa %s"

msgid "Use a Time Scroll"
msgstr "Pakai Gulungan Waktu"

msgid "Vibration"
msgstr "Getaran"

msgid "Voice Acting"
msgstr "Pengisi Suara"

msgid "Voice Volume"
msgstr "Volume Suara"

msgid "W-with you? Where would I even..."
msgstr "B-bersamamu? Di mana aku nanti..."

msgid "Warmth runs out of her and drips onto your stomach."
msgstr "Kehangatan mengalir keluar darinya dan menetes ke perutmu."

msgid "Watch a video: %s"
msgstr "Tonton video: %s"

msgid "We're getting the second owl, right?"
msgstr "Kita ambil burung hantu kedua, kan?"

msgid "Well. It worked, which is insulting in its own way. Go on, then. Ask."
msgstr "Yah. Berhasil, dan itu sendiri sudah menghina. Ayo, kalau begitu. Minta."

msgid "What a date!"
msgstr "Kencan yang luar biasa!"

msgid "What do you say?"
msgstr "Apa jawabanmu?"

msgid "What she likes"
msgstr "Yang dia suka"

msgid "What you want. Gold. Revenge. And sooner or later sex. It always comes to that."
msgstr "Apa yang kamu mau. Emas. Balas dendam. Dan cepat atau lambat seks. Selalu ujungnya ke situ."

msgid "When falling gems make new matches on their own, that's a combo. Each link in the chain scores more than the last."
msgstr "Saat permata yang jatuh membentuk kecocokan baru dengan sendirinya, itulah kombo. Setiap mata rantai bernilai lebih dari yang sebelumnya."

msgid "When you climb out you lean on the trunk to get your breath back. The bark is rough and cool under your hand."
msgstr "Saat kamu naik, kamu bersandar ke batang pohon untuk mengatur napas. Kulit kayunya kasar dan sejuk di bawah tanganmu."

msgid "When you get back, a branch creaks overhead in a way that sounds very deliberate."
msgstr "Saat kamu kembali, sebuah dahan berderak di atasmu dengan cara yang terdengar sangat disengaja."

msgid "Where are my things? They were here. In rows. I-I had them in rows."
msgstr "Di mana barang-barangku? Tadi di sini. Berbaris. A-aku menjajarkannya berbaris."

msgid "Where did you get that."
msgstr "Dari mana kamu dapat itu."

msgid "While you fetch coffee from the staff room, she takes a red pencil from your desk and starts correcting the page that started all this."
msgstr "Sementara kamu mengambil kopi di ruang staf, dia mengambil pensil merah dari mejamu dan mulai mengoreksi halaman yang memulai semua ini."

msgid "Who even likes those?"
msgstr "Siapa sih yang suka itu?"

msgid "Why would you do that?"
msgstr "Kenapa kamu melakukan itu?"

msgid "Window Shopping"
msgstr "Cuci Mata"

msgid "Wishlist on Steam"
msgstr "Tambahkan ke Wishlist Steam"

msgid "With Moves to Spare"
msgstr "Langkah Berlebih"

msgid "With the lamp down, the only light in your room comes from her: a soft lilac glow that brightens wherever you touch."
msgstr "Dengan lampu redup, satu-satunya cahaya di kamarmu berasal darinya: cahaya ungu muda yang lembut, yang makin terang di mana pun kamu menyentuhnya."

msgid "You"
msgstr "Kamu"

msgid "You already have this."
msgstr "Kamu sudah punya ini."

msgid "You also find a little brass clasp wedged under the pier. She takes it from you and turns it over for a long time."
msgstr "Kamu juga menemukan gesper kuningan kecil yang terjepit di bawah dermaga. Dia mengambilnya darimu dan memutar-mutarnya lama sekali."

msgid "You ask what she means."
msgstr "Kamu bertanya apa maksudnya."

msgid "You bring it down to the pier after dark. She holds it for a long time without saying anything."
msgstr "Kamu membawanya ke dermaga setelah gelap. Dia memegangnya lama tanpa berkata apa-apa."

msgid "You came by with an axe."
msgstr "Kamu datang membawa kapak."

msgid "You can actually swim. The first time, you looked like a coat someone had thrown off a pier."
msgstr "Ternyata kamu bisa berenang. Waktu pertama kali, kamu kelihatan seperti mantel yang dilempar orang dari dermaga."

msgid "You can close this tab now."
msgstr "Kamu bisa menutup tab ini sekarang."

msgid "You can get dressed now."
msgstr "Kamu boleh berpakaian sekarang."

msgid "You can hold my hand. If you don't mind it being a bit... wet."
msgstr "Kamu boleh menggandeng tanganku. Kalau tidak keberatan agak... basah."

msgid "You can stay with me. My place is quiet."
msgstr "Kamu bisa tinggal bersamaku. Rumahku tenang."

msgid "You close the door."
msgstr "Kamu menutup pintu."

msgid "You copied it off a loose page that fell out of a returned book. It looked nice. You put a candle stub in the middle because it seemed like the kind of thing that wanted a candle."
msgstr "Kamu menyalinnya dari halaman lepas yang jatuh dari buku yang dikembalikan. Kelihatannya bagus. Kamu menaruh puntung lilin di tengahnya karena kelihatannya itu jenis benda yang butuh lilin."

msgid "You could keep one, you know. Just one page. I wouldn't be able to refuse you anything."
msgstr "Kamu bisa menyimpan satu, tahu. Satu halaman saja. Aku tidak akan bisa menolak apa pun darimu."

msgid "You didn't ask what you get out of it."
msgstr "Kamu tidak bertanya apa untungnya buatmu."

msgid "You dig until sunset. The trench ends up about the length of a coffin, which she points out twice."
msgstr "Kamu menggali sampai matahari terbenam. Paritnya berakhir kira-kira sepanjang peti mati, dan dia menunjukkan hal itu dua kali."

msgid "You don't ask for any of it. You ask if she's all right, because she came out of the smoke coughing."
msgstr "Kamu tidak meminta satu pun. Kamu bertanya apakah dia baik-baik saja, karena dia keluar dari asap sambil batuk."

msgid "You don't take your time. She laughs at you, low in her throat, and doesn't complain."
msgstr "Kamu tidak santai. Dia menertawakanmu, rendah di tenggorokan, dan tidak mengeluh."

msgid "You don't think about it. You run down the steps, jump off the end of the pier in your clothes, get an arm round her and drag her back."
msgstr "Kamu tidak berpikir. Kamu berlari menuruni tangga, melompat dari ujung dermaga dengan pakaian lengkap, melingkarkan lengan di tubuhnya dan menariknya kembali."

msgid "You find the rhythm together. Her hips roll back as yours drive up. Wet skin claps on wet skin."
msgstr "Kalian menemukan iramanya bersama. Pinggulnya berguling ke belakang saat pinggulmu mendorong ke atas. Kulit basah menampar kulit basah."

msgid "You have %d"
msgstr "Kamu punya %d"

msgid "You hold it very well. That's all I'm admitting."
msgstr "Kamu memeganginya dengan sangat baik. Cuma itu yang kuakui."

msgid "You hum when you think. It's nice."
msgstr "Kamu bersenandung kalau sedang berpikir. Manis."

msgid "You laugh. She goes pink all the way through, and then she laughs too."
msgstr "Kamu tertawa. Dia jadi merah muda di sekujur tubuh, lalu ikut tertawa."

msgid "You leave your shoes on the pier, both of them."
msgstr "Kamu meninggalkan sepatumu di dermaga, dua-duanya."

msgid "You lie back along the fallen bough. She swings a knee over your hips and settles astride you, facing the river."
msgstr "Kamu berbaring telentang di sepanjang dahan yang tumbang. Dia mengayunkan satu lutut melewati pinggulmu dan duduk mengangkangimu, menghadap ke sungai."

msgid "You look from her to the trunk and back. Her heart is in the tree, then. So what's in her chest? Does she feel every woodpecker? Is the tree her, or is she the tree's way of talking? It doesn't feel like the moment to ask."
msgstr "Kamu memandang dia lalu batang pohon, lalu dia lagi. Jadi jantungnya ada di pohon. Lalu apa yang ada di dadanya? Apakah dia merasakan setiap burung pelatuk? Apakah pohon itu dirinya, atau dia cara pohon itu berbicara? Rasanya bukan saat yang tepat untuk bertanya."

msgid "You lower the axe. After a moment, you put it down on the grass."
msgstr "Kamu menurunkan kapak. Setelah sesaat, kamu meletakkannya di rumput."

msgid "You need %d more stars."
msgstr "Kamu butuh %d bintang lagi."

msgid "You needed %d more points."
msgstr "Kamu butuh %d poin lagi."

msgid "You plant your feet and thrust up into her as she comes down. She makes a sound you haven't heard from her before."
msgstr "Kamu menjejakkan kaki dan menyodok ke atas ke dalamnya saat dia turun. Dia mengeluarkan suara yang belum pernah kamu dengar darinya."

msgid "You point out that the label said newts."
msgstr "Kamu menunjukkan bahwa labelnya bilang kadal air."

msgid "You say another hazel, so she isn't the only one."
msgstr "Kamu bilang pohon hazel lagi, supaya dia tidak sendirian."

msgid "You say it back. She listens like she's checking your pronunciation."
msgstr "Kamu mengucapkannya kembali. Dia mendengarkan seolah memeriksa pelafalanmu."

msgid "You say it. Amara. She shuts her eyes, as if she's checking your pronunciation one last time."
msgstr "Kamu mengucapkannya. Amara. Dia memejamkan mata, seolah memeriksa pelafalanmu untuk terakhir kali."

msgid "You say yes. She talks for an hour without stuttering once."
msgstr "Kamu bilang iya. Dia bercerita sejam tanpa gagap sekali pun."

msgid "You shake your head."
msgstr "Kamu menggeleng."

msgid "You sit with your back against the trunk while it rains. Every so often she makes a small sound, and you put your hand flat on the bark. Under your palm, right about where you'd have swung the axe, something in the wood is beating. So that answers that."
msgstr "Kamu duduk bersandar ke batang pohon selama hujan. Sesekali dia mengeluarkan suara kecil, dan kamu meletakkan telapak tanganmu rata di kulit kayu. Di bawah telapakmu, kira-kira di tempat kamu akan mengayunkan kapak, sesuatu di dalam kayu berdetak. Jadi terjawab sudah."

msgid "You squeeze her and pull her open with your thumbs. Her breath catches, and her hips stutter."
msgstr "Kamu meremasnya dan membukanya dengan ibu jarimu. Napasnya tertahan, dan pinggulnya tersendat."

msgid "You start to take your hand away. She says you don't have to."
msgstr "Kamu mulai menarik tanganmu. Dia bilang kamu tidak perlu."

msgid "You stay."
msgstr "Kamu menginap."

msgid "You summoned me with that pathetic chalk circle? Where did you even copy it from? Ugh, I was in the middle of something."
msgstr "Kamu memanggilku dengan lingkaran kapur menyedihkan itu? Kamu menyalinnya dari mana sih? Ugh, aku sedang sibuk."

msgid "You take the lantern off her and tell her to sit down for an hour. You'll do the rocks."
msgstr "Kamu mengambil lentera darinya dan menyuruhnya duduk sejam. Kamu yang mengurus bebatuan."

msgid "You tell her about the wall. Her roots are cracking it, and when it goes, the miller loses his mill."
msgstr "Kamu memberitahunya soal dinding itu. Akarnya membuatnya retak, dan kalau dinding itu runtuh, tukang giling kehilangan kincirnya."

msgid "You tell her it fell out of a returned book, and you didn't check which one. You step towards the desk to show her."
msgstr "Kamu bilang halaman itu jatuh dari buku yang dikembalikan, dan kamu tidak memeriksa buku yang mana. Kamu melangkah ke meja untuk menunjukkannya."

msgid "You tell her it isn't strange. She pulls you closer, and for once she doesn't apologise for anything."
msgstr "Kamu bilang ini tidak aneh. Dia menarikmu lebih dekat, dan untuk sekali ini dia tidak minta maaf atas apa pun."

msgid "You tell her she should tell it."
msgstr "Kamu bilang dia saja yang cerita."

msgid "You tell her to keep it. For storms."
msgstr "Kamu bilang simpan saja. Untuk saat badai."

msgid "You tell her to put yours."
msgstr "Kamu bilang tulis alamatmu."

msgid "You tell her you haven't watched a single game."
msgstr "Kamu bilang kamu belum pernah menonton satu permainan pun."

msgid "You tell her. The stream has already carried most of it round the bend, towards town."
msgstr "Kamu memberitahunya. Sungai sudah membawa sebagian besar ke balik tikungan, ke arah kota."

msgid "You turn the lamp down."
msgstr "Kamu mengecilkan lampu."

msgid "You wake up in the boathouse on a heap of old sails, with sand in your ears. She's already in the water, arms folded on the edge of the slipway, watching you."
msgstr "Kamu terbangun di gudang perahu di atas tumpukan layar tua, telingamu penuh pasir. Dia sudah di air, lengannya terlipat di tepi landasan, memperhatikanmu."

msgid "You want a thank-you? For that?"
msgstr "Kamu mau terima kasih? Untuk itu?"

msgid "You want to hear about buttons?"
msgstr "Kamu mau dengar soal kancing?"

msgid "You were incredible."
msgstr "Kamu luar biasa."

msgid "You'd burn it."
msgstr "Kamu akan membakarnya."

msgid "You'd have struck just below my heart. It would take... forty years or so to heal."
msgstr "Kamu akan menebas tepat di bawah jantungku. Butuh... kira-kira empat puluh tahun untuk sembuh."

msgid "You're a genius, you're a soaked genius."
msgstr "Kamu jenius, jenius yang basah kuyup."

msgid "You're a terrible influence. Keep going."
msgstr "Kamu pengaruh yang buruk sekali. Teruskan."

msgid "You're doing well. I'm counting."
msgstr "Kamu hebat. Aku menghitung."

msgid "You're getting good at this. It's annoying."
msgstr "Kamu jadi jago. Menyebalkan."

msgid "You're good with soft things."
msgstr "Kamu pintar dengan hal-hal yang lembut."

msgid "You're new in town and you'll take any work that pays. The miller paid you half up front to cut the tree down. You pick a spot on the trunk that looks right, plant your feet and lift the axe."
msgstr "Kamu baru di kota dan mengambil pekerjaan apa saja yang dibayar. Tukang giling membayarmu separuh di muka untuk menebang pohon itu. Kamu memilih titik di batang yang kelihatan pas, menapakkan kaki, dan mengangkat kapak."

msgid "You're not jealous? Your leaves are going red."
msgstr "Kamu tidak cemburu? Daunmu memerah."

msgid "You're quicker than you look. You look quite slow."
msgstr "Kamu lebih cepat dari kelihatannya. Dan kamu kelihatan cukup lamban."

msgid "You're shaking. Come in closer, there's a hollow in the trunk that fits you."
msgstr "Kamu gemetar. Mendekatlah, ada lubang di batang yang pas untukmu."

msgid "You're still warm. Good."
msgstr "Kamu masih hangat. Bagus."

msgid "You're the best thing I've found in this library."
msgstr "Kamu hal terbaik yang kutemukan di perpustakaan ini."

msgid "You're welcome, by the way."
msgstr "Sama-sama, omong-omong."

msgid "You've asked me twice not to sit on this table."
msgstr "Kamu sudah dua kali memintaku jangan duduk di meja ini."

msgid "You've been in Millbrook three weeks, taking whatever work pays. Tonight that's the late shift at the public library. It's a quarter past midnight, the gas lamps have been out for an hour, the returns cart is still full, and you've drawn a circle on the reading room floor in children's chalk."
msgstr "Kamu baru tiga minggu di Millbrook, mengambil pekerjaan apa saja yang dibayar. Malam ini itu berarti giliran malam di perpustakaan umum. Sudah lewat seperempat jam dari tengah malam, lampu gas sudah padam sejam lalu, troli buku kembalian masih penuh, dan kamu menggambar lingkaran di lantai ruang baca dengan kapur anak-anak."

msgid "You've got mud on your face. Leave it. It suits you."
msgstr "Ada lumpur di wajahmu. Biarkan saja. Cocok untukmu."

msgid "You've got sand on you. Everywhere. That's your problem, I'm not helping."
msgstr "Kamu penuh pasir. Di mana-mana. Itu masalahmu, aku tidak mau bantu."

msgid "You've helped enough for one day, lifeguard."
msgstr "Kamu sudah cukup membantu hari ini, penyelamat."

msgid "You... jumped in your clothes. For someone you'd never met."
msgstr "Kamu... melompat dengan pakaian lengkap. Demi orang yang belum pernah kamu temui."

msgid "Your best: %d"
msgstr "Rekormu: %d"

msgid "Your hands find her ass. She's warm all the way through, like bark at the end of a July day."
msgstr "Tanganmu menemukan pantatnya. Dia hangat sampai ke dalam, seperti kulit kayu di akhir hari bulan Juli."

msgid "Your name would be nice."
msgstr "Namamu, itu saja sudah cukup."

msgid "Your next chapter begins with a free Starburst gem already on the board."
msgstr "Bab berikutnya dimulai dengan permata Ledakan Bintang gratis yang sudah ada di papan."

msgid "Your next chapter: far fewer cursed shards appear on the board."
msgstr "Bab berikutnya: jauh lebih sedikit pecahan terkutuk di papan."

msgid "Your next chapter: her favorite gem shows up more often, her least favorite less."
msgstr "Bab berikutnya: permata favoritnya lebih sering muncul, yang paling tidak dia suka lebih jarang."

msgid "Your purchase is pending. It arrives as soon as Google Play confirms it."
msgstr "Pembelianmu tertunda. Akan masuk begitu Google Play mengonfirmasinya."

msgid "Your replies"
msgstr "Jawabanmu"

msgid "Your second ring doesn't close. That sigil is upside down. And this one isn't a sigil at all, it's a coffee stain you traced."
msgstr "Cincin keduamu tidak tertutup. Sigil itu terbalik. Dan yang ini sama sekali bukan sigil, ini noda kopi yang kamu jiplak."

msgid "Yours. Fine. I'm bringing my own candles."
msgstr "Alamatmu. Baiklah. Aku bawa lilinku sendiri."

msgid "a button"
msgstr "sebuah kancing"

msgid "a key"
msgstr "sebuah kunci"

msgid "a marble"
msgstr "sebuah kelereng"

msgid "after your next move"
msgstr "setelah langkahmu berikutnya"

msgid "best %d"
msgstr "rekor %d"

msgid "double it to %d ⭐"
msgstr "lipat gandakan jadi %d ⭐"

msgid "in %d moves"
msgstr "dalam %d langkah"

msgid "one more daily try"
msgstr "satu percobaan harian lagi"

msgid "the glass eye"
msgstr "mata kaca"

msgid "←  Back"
msgstr "←  Kembali"

msgid "←  Back to the chapter"
msgstr "←  Kembali ke bab"

msgid "←  Menu"
msgstr "←  Menu"

msgid "←  Roster"
msgstr "←  Lingkaran"
